Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.93,0:04:19.74,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到盖特卡公司\N{\rEN4K}Welcome to Gattaca.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:24.31,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你的工作站很干净 杰罗姆\N{\rEN4K}You keep your workstation so clean, Jerome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.61,0:05:26.05,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,清洁近乎圣洁\N{\rEN4K}It's next to godliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.78,0:05:27.95,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不都是这么说的吗\N{\rEN4K}Isn't that what they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.28,0:05:29.61,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,圣洁\N{\rEN4K}Godliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.12,0:05:31.77,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我看了你的飞行计划\N{\rEN4K}I reviewed your flight plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.78,0:05:35.38,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,百万次击键 零失误\N{\rEN4K}Not one error in a million keystrokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.38,0:05:36.47,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,很了不起\N{\rEN4K}Phenomenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.82,0:05:40.69,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,找你这样的人带我们去泰坦星果然没错\N{\rEN4K}It's right that someone like you is taking us to Titan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.17,0:05:42.94,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,委员会批准这次任务了吗\N{\rEN4K}Has the committee approved the mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.77,0:05:45.12,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,有传闻说要延迟\N{\rEN4K}There's been talk of delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.12,0:05:47.72,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你不该道听途说\N{\rEN4K}You shouldn't listen to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.93,0:05:49.36,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你一周后动身\N{\rEN4K}You leave in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.50,0:05:52.50,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你得去做个物质检测\N{\rEN4K}You've got a substance test.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.30,0:06:26.73,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,如果您被通知去做物质分析\N{\rEN4K}If you have been notified for substance analysis,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.73,0:06:29.17,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,请到检测中心报到\N{\rEN4K}please report to the testing center.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:40.79,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,杰罗姆 从不害羞 让尿就尿\N{\rEN4K}Jerome. Never shy. Pisses on command.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.21,0:06:43.77,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你下面那家伙长得挺好看 杰罗姆\N{\rEN4K}A beautiful piece of equipment there, Jerome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.77,0:06:44.79,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,有人这么跟你说过吗\N{\rEN4K}Whoever told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.79,0:06:46.49,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,只有我每次来的时候你会跟我说\N{\rEN4K}Only every time I'm in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.10,0:06:48.49,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,职业病\N{\rEN4K}Occupational hazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.25,0:06:51.59,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我每天都能看到很多那玩意儿\N{\rEN4K}I see a great many in the course of any given day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.99,0:06:54.79,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你的刚好特别惊艳\N{\rEN4K}Yours just happens to be an exceptional example.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.09,0:06:58.48,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么我爸妈当初没给我订一根那样的阴茎\N{\rEN4K}Why my folks didn't order one like that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:15.54,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,顺便\N{\rEN4K}By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.68,0:07:18.45,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我有跟你提过我儿子吗\N{\rEN4K}have I ever told you about my son?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:19.82,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不 你没提过\N{\rEN4K}No. you haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.97,0:07:21.53,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,记得提醒我哪天跟你说说\N{\rEN4K}Remind me to sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.78,0:07:27.75,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你要升空了 还有一周就要走了\N{\rEN4K}So you're about to go up. One week left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.94,0:07:30.94,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是有那么点兴奋的吧\N{\rEN4K}Please tell me you're the least bit excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.47,0:07:35.95,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我到周末再告诉你\N{\rEN4K}I'll tell you at the end of the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.89,0:07:50.50,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,祝贺你 杰罗姆\N{\rEN4K}Congratulations, Jerome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.73,0:07:54.57,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEN4K}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.99,0:08:01.64,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,每天要发射多少次 十二次吗\N{\rEN4K}How many launches are there in a day? A dozen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.62,0:08:04.70,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,有时更多\N{\rEN4K}Sometimes more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.83,0:08:08.74,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你是唯一一个每次发射都会看的人\N{\rEN4K}You're the only one who watches every one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:15.99,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你想假装你不在乎\N{\rEN4K}If you're going to pretend like you don't care,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.31,0:08:17.34,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那就别抬头\N{\rEN4K}don't look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.12,0:08:22.53,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,再平凡不过的事\N{\rEN4K}The most unremarkable of events.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.01,0:08:25.96,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,杰罗姆·莫罗 一级领航员\N{\rEN4K}Jerome Morrow, Navigator 1st Class,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:29.67,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,即将开始为期一年的载人任务 飞向泰坦星\N{\rEN4K}is about to embark on a one-year manned mission to Titan,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:32.27,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,土星的第十四颗卫星\N{\rEN4K}the 14th moon of Saturn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.16,0:08:34.65,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个非常光荣的任务\N{\rEN4K}A highly prestigious assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.65,0:08:36.02,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管对杰罗姆来说\N{\rEN4K}Although, for Jerome...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.15,0:08:39.12,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他几乎一出生就注定要参加\N{\rEN4K}selection was virtually guaranteed at birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.73,0:08:44.25,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他拥有此项任务所需的所有天赋\N{\rEN4K}He's blessed with all the gifts required for such an undertaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.31,0:08:46.87,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,基因商无人可比\N{\rEN4K}A genetic quotient second to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.84,0:08:50.29,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不 杰罗姆·莫罗的进步\N{\rEN4K}No, there's truly nothing remarkable
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.29,0:08:52.57,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,真的没什么好让人意外的\N{\rEN4K}about the progress of Jerome Morrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.44,0:08:56.74,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,只不过 我并不是杰罗姆·莫罗\N{\rEN4K}Except that I am not Jerome Morrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.69,0:09:07.75,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我母亲是在里维埃拉怀上我的\N{\rEN4K}I was conceived in the Riviera.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.45,0:09:10.09,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不是那个法国的度假胜地\N{\rEN4K}Not the French Riviera.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.77,0:09:12.17,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,是在底特律产的别克里维埃拉车里\N{\rEN4K}The Detroit variety.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.35,0:09:15.05,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,人们过去常说\N{\rEN4K}They used to say
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.05,0:09:18.44,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,因爱受孕的孩子更有可能会幸福\N{\rEN4K}that a child conceived in love has a greater chance of happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.18,0:09:21.73,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但人们不再这么说了\N{\rEN4K}They don't say that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:27.10,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我从不明白我妈究竟是被什么迷了心窍\N{\rEN4K}I never understand what possessed my mother
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.10,0:09:28.88,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,去信仰上帝\N{\rEN4K}to put her faith in God's hand
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.88,0:09:31.25,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,而不是信她当地的遗传学家\N{\rEN4K}rather than those of her local geneticist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.80,0:09:38.10,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,过去出生的孩子 只要手脚健全就好\N{\rEN4K}Ten fingers, ten toes, that's all that used to matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.29,0:09:39.23,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在不是了\N{\rEN4K}Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.72,0:09:41.42,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我刚出生几秒\N{\rEN4K}Now only seconds old,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.42,0:09:45.37,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们已经知道了我确切的死亡时间和原因\N{\rEN4K}the exact time and cause of my death was already known.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.62,0:09:53.55,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,神经系统疾病 可能性60%\N{\rEN4K}Neurological condition, 60 percent probability,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.72,0:09:56.59,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,躁郁症 可能性42%\N{\rEN4K}manic depression, 42 percent probability.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.90,0:10:00.46,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,多动症 可能性89%\N{\rEN4K}Attention deficit disorder, 89 percent probability.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.46,0:10:05.56,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,心脏病 可能性99%\N{\rEN4K}Heart disorder: 99 percent probability.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.69,0:10:07.24,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,有早夭可能\N{\rEN4K}Early fatal potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.65,0:10:11.21,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,预计寿命 30.2岁\N{\rEN4K}Life expectancy: 30.2 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.31,0:10:13.77,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,30岁\N{\rEN4K}30 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.35,0:10:17.37,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-出生证明上写什么名字 -安东\N{\rEN4K}- The name for the certificate? - Anton.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.37,0:10:20.44,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不 文森特·安东\N{\rEN4K}No. Vincent Anton.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.16,0:10:25.60,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 那名字不错\N{\rEN4K}Yeah. That's a good name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.10,0:10:30.43,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道他会有所作为的\N{\rEN4K}I know he'll do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.55,0:10:32.61,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你会有作为的\N{\rEN4K}You'll do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.70,0:10:37.76,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,文森特\N{\rEN4K}Vincent?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:39.40,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我从很小的时候开始\N{\rEN4K}From an early age I came to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.40,0:10:41.55,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,就开始用别人看待我的方式看待自己\N{\rEN4K}think of myself as others thought of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.56,0:10:43.13,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-文森特 -有慢性病\N{\rEN4K}- Vincent! - Chronically ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.32,0:10:45.48,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,每次膝盖擦破皮 或者流鼻涕\N{\rEN4K}Every skinned knee and runny nose
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:47.79,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,都仿佛有生命危险\N{\rEN4K}was treated as if it were life threatening
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.06,0:10:51.11,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 保险不涵盖的 如果他摔倒\N{\rEN4K}I'm sorry, the insurance won't cover it. If he fell--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.11,0:10:52.72,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但当时跟我说的是一切都\N{\rEN4K}But I was told that everything was --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.72,0:10:54.47,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我真希望能帮得上忙\N{\rEN4K}I really wish there's something I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:06.57,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,就跟很多当时的父母一样\N{\rEN4K}Like most other parents of their day,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.57,0:11:08.70,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们决定 他们的下一个孩子\N{\rEN4K}they were determined that their next child...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.71,0:11:12.76,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,将以当时已经成为自然的方式出生\N{\rEN4K}would be brought into the world in what has become the natural way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.55,0:11:17.40,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,从你体内提取出的卵子 玛丽\N{\rEN4K}Your extracted eggs, Marie,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.85,0:11:22.32,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,已经和安东尼奥的精子结合成为受精卵\N{\rEN4K}have been fertilised with Antonio's sperm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.13,0:11:24.92,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,在筛选过后 我们还剩下\N{\rEN4K}After screening we are left as you see
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:28.92,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,两个健康的男孩和两个十分健康的女孩\N{\rEN4K}with two healthy boys and two very healthy girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.15,0:11:29.58,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,自然\N{\rEN4K}Naturally,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.58,0:11:33.17,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,都是没有任何重大遗传病的\N{\rEN4K}no critical predispositions to any of the major inheritable diseases.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.39,0:11:36.12,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,所以只剩下选出最合适的受精卵这一项了\N{\rEN4K}All that remains is to select the most compatible candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.67,0:11:39.97,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们最好先决定性别\N{\rEN4K}First, we may as well decide on gender.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.97,0:11:41.19,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你们有想过要男孩还是女孩吗\N{\rEN4K}Have you given it any thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.59,0:11:46.21,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想让文森特有个弟弟当玩伴\N{\rEN4K}We would want Vincent to have a brother you know, to play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.55,0:11:50.37,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-那是当然 你好啊 文森特 -你好\N{\rEN4K}- Of course you would. Hello, Vincent. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.72,0:11:55.52,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你们指定了淡褐色眼睛 黑发和白皮肤\N{\rEN4K}You have specified hazel eyes, dark hair and a fair skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.87,0:11:57.68,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我自作主张地\N{\rEN4K}I've taken the liberty
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.68,0:12:00.13,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,帮你们剔除了各种潜在的不利情况\N{\rEN4K}of eradicating any potentially prejudicial conditions:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.55,0:12:02.41,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,早秃 近视\N{\rEN4K}Premature baldness, myopia,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.55,0:12:04.69,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,酗酒和成瘾倾向\N{\rEN4K}alcoholism and addictive susceptibility,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.00,0:12:06.85,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,暴力倾向 肥胖等等\N{\rEN4K}propensity for violence, obesity etc..
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.85,0:12:10.61,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不想让孩子生病 那是肯定的 但\N{\rEN4K}We didn't want-- I mean, diseases, yes. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.75,0:12:12.75,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 我们只是在想能不能\N{\rEN4K}Right. we were just wondering if
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.93,0:12:15.65,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,能不能放任一些东西自由发展\N{\rEN4K}if its good to just leave a few things to chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.66,0:12:18.61,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你们会想让孩子尽可能地赢在起跑线上\N{\rEN4K}You want to give your child the best possible start.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.03,0:12:21.56,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我 目前已经有很多天生的瑕疵了\N{\rEN4K}Believe me, we have enough imperfection built-in already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.19,0:12:24.36,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的孩子不需要额外的负担\N{\rEN4K}Your child doesn't need any additional burdens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.31,0:12:27.59,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,记着 这个孩子还是会遗传二位的基因\N{\rEN4K}And keep in mind, this child is still you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.01,0:12:29.70,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,只不过是最好的那部分\N{\rEN4K}Simply the best of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.86,0:12:33.05,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,自然受孕再多次\N{\rEN4K}You could conceive naturally 1,000 times
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.05,0:12:34.77,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,也达不到这样的效果\N{\rEN4K}and never get such a result.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:40.26,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我弟弟安东就是这样出生的\N{\rEN4K}That's how my brother Anton came to into the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.73,0:12:43.98,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,一个让我父亲骄傲到用自己的名字给他命名的儿子\N{\rEN4K}A son my father considered worthy of his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.83,0:13:00.27,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我说什么来着 看他长得多块\N{\rEN4K}What did I tell you. See how much he's grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.64,0:13:17.92,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然那时我们假装是血亲兄弟\N{\rEN4K}By the time we were playing at blood brothers,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.97,0:13:18.70,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但我明白\N{\rEN4K}I understood that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.70,0:13:21.73,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,自己血管里流动的东西与安东的大不相同\N{\rEN4K}there was something very different flowing through my veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.33,0:13:24.75,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我想有所成就\N{\rEN4K}And I'd need an awful lot more than a drop
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.75,0:13:26.43,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,所要争取的远不止一点点\N{\rEN4K}if I was going to get anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:50.26,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们最喜欢的游戏叫做"胆小鬼"\N{\rEN4K}Our favorite game was "chicken":
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.71,0:13:52.11,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,当爸妈不在身边时\N{\rEN4K}When our parents weren't watching,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.11,0:13:54.57,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会尽可能向远处游\N{\rEN4K}we used to swim as far out as we dared
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:57.87,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,看谁先害怕往回游\N{\rEN4K}It was about who would get scared and turn back first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.73,0:14:14.22,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊 胆小鬼\N{\rEN4K}Come on, you coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.99,0:14:19.47,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 输的总是我\N{\rEN4K}Of course, it was always me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.95,0:14:22.40,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,安东比我强壮得多\N{\rEN4K}Anton was by far the stronger swimmer
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:24.18,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,没有理由输\N{\rEN4K}and he had no excuse to fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.80,0:14:33.78,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,三亿 三亿五千万 四亿\N{\rEN4K}300 million, 350 million, 400 million...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.78,0:14:35.83,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,或许是因为我对行星的热爱\N{\rEN4K}Maybe it was the love of the planets,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.25,0:14:38.83,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,又或许只是我越来越不喜欢地球\N{\rEN4K}maybe it was just my growing dislike for this one,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.11,0:14:41.12,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但自从我记事开始\N{\rEN4K}but for as long as I can remember
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.12,0:14:43.18,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我就梦想进入太空\N{\rEN4K}I've dreamed of going into space.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.18,0:14:46.07,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,七亿 七亿五千万\N{\rEN4K}700 million, 750 million,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.07,0:14:49.61,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,八亿 八亿五千万\N{\rEN4K}800 million, 850 million...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.42,0:14:52.34,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你说到底有多少宇航员啊\N{\rEN4K}How many astronauts are there anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.24,0:14:56.63,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我想当的话一定能当上\N{\rEN4K}I bet I could be one if I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.63,0:14:59.25,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,别吃 那是冥王星\N{\rEN4K}Hey. Don't eat that. It's Pluto.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:06.00,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,之后的日子 我的目标也没有太大改变\N{\rEN4K}My goals didn't change a lot in the intervening years...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.01,0:15:06.94,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,文森特\N{\rEN4K}Vincent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.94,0:15:08.66,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这让我父母很沮丧\N{\rEN4K}Much to my parents' dismay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.00,0:15:10.87,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,文森特\N{\rEN4K}Vincent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.51,0:15:19.12,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你得实际一点\N{\rEN4K}You have to be realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.45,0:15:21.37,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你有心脏问题\N{\rEN4K}With a heart condition like yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.81,0:15:25.47,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,妈 有可能我的心脏根本没事\N{\rEN4K}Mom, there's a chance that there is nothing even wrong with my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.31,0:15:27.58,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,1%的几率\N{\rEN4K}One chance in a hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.05,0:15:31.84,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-这个险我愿意冒 行了吧 -问题是他们不愿意\N{\rEN4K}- I'll take it, alright. - The trouble is they won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.01,0:15:34.90,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 看在上帝的份儿上\N{\rEN4K}Listen, for God's sake,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.28,0:15:36.62,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你得清楚\N{\rEN4K}you gotta understand something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.28,0:15:45.19,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一能让你看到太空船内部的方法\N{\rEN4K}The only way that you'll see the inside of a spaceship
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.19,0:15:46.59,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,就是去做清洁工\N{\rEN4K}is if you are cleaning it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.90,0:15:49.37,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸说得没错\N{\rEN4K}My father was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.75,0:15:52.22,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不管我怎样在简历上自吹自擂\N{\rEN4K}It didn't matter how much I lied on my résumé,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.59,0:15:54.90,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我真正的简历在我的细胞里\N{\rEN4K}My real résumé was in my cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.49,0:15:58.98,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要投入那么多钱来训练我呢\N{\rEN4K}Why should anybody invest all that money to train me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.98,0:16:02.91,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟比我经历清白的应聘者多得是\N{\rEN4K}when there are 1000 other applicants with a far cleaner profile?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.48,0:16:05.73,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 歧视是违法的\N{\rEN4K}Of course, it is illegal to discriminate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.15,0:16:07.79,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,人们称之为"基因主义"\N{\rEN4K}"Genoism," it's called.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.32,0:16:10.97,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但没人拿法律当回事儿\N{\rEN4K}But no one takes the law seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.13,0:16:20.27,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不肯说实话\N{\rEN4K}If you refuse to disclose,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.28,0:16:22.87,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们总能找到检测样本 从门把手上\N{\rEN4K}they can always take a sample from a door handle
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.27,0:16:24.60,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,从一次握手\N{\rEN4K}or a handshake...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.60,0:16:27.10,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至是从你申请表上的唾液\N{\rEN4K}even the saliva off your application form.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.13,0:16:33.12,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,若有疑问 一次合法的药物测试便会轻松成为\N{\rEN4K}If in doubt, a legal drug test can just easily become
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.12,0:16:36.42,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,一窥你在公司未来的非法手段\N{\rEN4K}an illegal peek at your future in the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.93,0:16:46.40,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\rEN4K}Sure you want to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.82,0:16:48.12,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道你会输的\N{\rEN4K}You know you're gonna lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.94,0:17:01.16,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我们最后一次一起游泳\N{\rEN4K}It was the last time we swam together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.51,0:17:03.28,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,游向大海深处\N{\rEN4K}Out into the open sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.99,0:17:06.74,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,像往常一样 心里清楚向地平线每划一次水\N{\rEN4K}Like always, knowing each stroke to the horizon
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.74,0:17:09.16,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,就意味着返程时要多划一次\N{\rEN4K}was one we'd have to make back to the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:25.42,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但那一天有些事情很不一样\N{\rEN4K}But something was very different about that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.14,0:17:28.36,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,每次安东想拉开距离\N{\rEN4K}Every time Anton tried to pull away
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.36,0:17:30.46,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,都会发现我就在他身边\N{\rEN4K}he found me right beside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.11,0:17:37.84,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,直到最后 奇迹发生了\N{\rEN4K}Until finally, the impossible happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.21,0:17:40.70,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,文森特 文森特\N{\rEN4K}Vincent! Vincent!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.62,0:17:57.56,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我们这一生中唯一一次\N{\rEN4K}It was the one moment in our lives
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.57,0:18:00.43,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我的弟弟没有他想象的那么强\N{\rEN4K}that my brother was not as strong as he believed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.43,0:18:01.97,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,而我也并非那么弱\N{\rEN4K}and I was not as weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.83,0:18:05.70,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那一刻 让接下来的一切变成了可能\N{\rEN4K}It was the moment that made everything else possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.93,0:18:51.98,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,像其他跟我境况相同的人一样\N{\rEN4K}Like many others in my situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.98,0:18:54.08,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,在接下来的几年里 我四处奔走\N{\rEN4K}I moved around a lot in the next few years,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.08,0:18:55.57,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,找我能做的工作\N{\rEN4K}getting work where I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.71,0:18:59.14,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我差不多打扫了州里一半的厕所\N{\rEN4K}I must've cleaned half the toilets in the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.69,0:19:02.92,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我属于一个新的社会底层\N{\rEN4K}I belong to a new underclass,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.92,0:19:06.73,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不再以社会地位或肤色来划分\N{\rEN4K}no longer determined by social status or the color of your skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.66,0:19:09.21,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到盖特卡公司 先生们\N{\rEN4K}Welcome to Gattaca, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.21,0:19:13.45,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我们现在完美掌控了歧视\N{\rEN4K}No, we now have discrimination down to a science.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.45,0:19:15.65,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,拿好你们的清洁工具\N{\rEN4K}Alright, there's your cleaning material.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.84,0:19:18.57,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,从前面开始一直打扫到后面\N{\rEN4K}Start from the front and clean all the way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.37,0:19:22.69,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,地板要擦到可以照人为止\N{\rEN4K}And I wanna see my smiling face on that floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.17,0:19:33.96,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么回事 大人\N{\rEN4K}What about you, your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.98,0:19:35.33,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,幻想上太空吗\N{\rEN4K}You dreaming of space?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.64,0:19:37.57,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,过来\N{\rEN4K}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.73,0:19:45.64,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你得从打扫这块空间开始\N{\rEN4K}You have to start by cleaning this space right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.50,0:19:52.61,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,直到我就站在我梦想的面前那一刻\N{\rEN4K}I was never more certain of how far away I was from my goal
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.61,0:19:54.95,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我才清楚地意识到自己离它有多遥远\N{\rEN4K}when I was standing right beside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.22,0:21:09.77,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,文森特 玻璃别擦太干净了\N{\rEN4K}When you clean the glass, Vincent, don't clean it too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.77,0:21:10.66,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\rEN4K}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.68,0:21:13.43,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,省得你胡思乱想\N{\rEN4K}You might get ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.22,0:21:15.58,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果玻璃干净了\N{\rEN4K}Yeah, but if the glass is clean,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.58,0:21:18.27,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,等我到玻璃那边 你就能看得更清楚了\N{\rEN4K}it'll be easier for you to see me when I'm on the other side of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.59,0:22:13.15,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我嘴硬 但我知道 也就这样了\N{\rEN4K}For all my brave talk, I knew it was just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.64,0:22:16.29,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不管我如何锻炼和学习\N{\rEN4K}No matter how much I trained or how much I studied,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.71,0:22:18.96,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,有世界第一的成绩也没用\N{\rEN4K}the best test score in the world wasn't gonna matter
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.96,0:22:21.22,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,除非我可以通过血液测试\N{\rEN4K}unless I had the blood test to go with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.83,0:22:26.58,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我下定决心 采取非常手段\N{\rEN4K}I made up my mind to resort to more extreme measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.92,0:22:29.03,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,出现在我门口的那个男人\N{\rEN4K}The man who showed up at my doorstep
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.16,0:22:31.83,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,需要点特殊渠道才能找到\N{\rEN4K}didn't exactly advertise in the Yellow Pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.83,0:22:32.84,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,站直\N{\rEN4K}Stand straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.46,0:22:36.67,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么知道我的\N{\rEN4K}How did you hear about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.58,0:22:38.46,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,听人说的\N{\rEN4K}People.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.43,0:22:40.94,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,身上有什么明显标记吗\N{\rEN4K}Any distinguishing marks?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.94,0:22:43.17,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,纹身 伤疤 胎记\N{\rEN4K}Tattoos, scars, birthmarks?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.44,0:22:46.42,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,应该没有\N{\rEN4K}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.93,0:22:49.21,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你下定决心了吗\N{\rEN4K}Are you serious about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.77,0:22:51.40,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你不是在浪费我的时间\N{\rEN4K}I hope you're not wasting my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.56,0:22:54.15,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都愿意\N{\rEN4K}I-I'd give a hundred percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.12,0:22:56.59,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就成功了一半\N{\rEN4K}That'll get you halfway there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.99,0:23:00.45,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那是老版的 不过\N{\rEN4K}That's an old edition, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.33,0:23:02.63,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经烂熟于心了\N{\rEN4K}I know it all by heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.35,0:23:04.43,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,烂熟于心\N{\rEN4K}By heart, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.27,0:23:10.00,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你明白这件事承诺了就不能反悔\N{\rEN4K}You realize the commitment is binding.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.04,0:23:12.39,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你有人选了吗\N{\rEN4K}You have somebody in mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.02,0:23:35.84,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,对于基因优越的人而言\N{\rEN4K}For the genetically superior,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.84,0:23:37.94,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,想获得成功相对容易\N{\rEN4K}success is easier to attain...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.19,0:23:40.36,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但并没有绝对保证\N{\rEN4K}but is by no means guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.86,0:23:43.89,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟 没有基因能谱写命运\N{\rEN4K}After all, there is no gene for fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.55,0:23:46.81,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,当出于某种原因\N{\rEN4K}And when, for one reason or another...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.87,0:23:49.93,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,某位精英被困难打倒\N{\rEN4K}a member of the elite falls on hard times,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.95,0:23:51.22,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的基因身份\N{\rEN4K}their genetic identity
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.22,0:23:54.22,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,就会成为黑市中的的宝贵商品\N{\rEN4K}becomes a valued commodity for the unscrupulous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.63,0:23:57.18,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,一个人的损失让另一个人获益\N{\rEN4K}One man's loss is another's gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.39,0:23:59.00,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他的资历无懈可击\N{\rEN4K}His credentials are impeccable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.41,0:24:01.66,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,预期寿命长得令人难以置信\N{\rEN4K}An expiration date you wouldn't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.14,0:24:09.21,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他几乎会长生不死\N{\rEN4K}The guy's practically gonna live forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.45,0:24:11.78,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,智商高得惊人\N{\rEN4K}He's got an I.Q. off the register.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.32,0:24:14.47,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,双眼视力超出寻常\N{\rEN4K}Better than 20/20 in both eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.08,0:24:16.37,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,心脏如公牛般强健\N{\rEN4K}And the heart of an ox.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.62,0:24:18.35,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他跑起来能冲破一面墙\N{\rEN4K}He could run through a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.51,0:24:24.77,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,前提是他还能跑的话\N{\rEN4K}If he could still run.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.58,0:24:30.99,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,其实他过去是游泳健将\N{\rEN4K}Actually, he was a big-time swimming star.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.51,0:24:32.44,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,文森特\N{\rEN4K}Vincent.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.51,0:24:34.79,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,有他的基因\N{\rEN4K}You could go anywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.79,0:24:37.04,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你想去哪里都不会吃闭门羹\N{\rEN4K}with this guy's helix tucked under your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.10,0:24:42.20,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前是怎么说的\N{\rEN4K}What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.65,0:24:45.17,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你们长得这么像 我都想加倍收费了\N{\rEN4K}You look so right together, I wanna double my fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.56,0:24:47.67,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-我们一点都不像 -已经够像了\N{\rEN4K}- We don't look anything alike. - It's close enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.98,0:24:50.28,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,如今谁还会仔细看一张照片\N{\rEN4K}When was the last time anybody looked at a photograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.30,0:24:52.69,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,老天 就算你证件上用我的照片都没事\N{\rEN4K}You could have my face on your name tag, for Christ's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.17,0:24:54.86,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,车祸的事我该怎么向人解释\N{\rEN4K}How do I explain the accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.86,0:24:56.43,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,妙就妙在这\N{\rEN4K}That's the beautiful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.09,0:24:58.82,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,车祸是在国外发生的\N{\rEN4K}It happened out of the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.94,0:25:01.03,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他下身瘫痪的事根本没有记录\N{\rEN4K}There's no record he ever broke his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.25,0:25:02.70,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,在人们眼里\N{\rEN4K}As far as anyone's concerned,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.70,0:25:04.00,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他还能说会走\N{\rEN4K}he's still a walking, talking,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.00,0:25:06.21,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,是社会里健全的一分子\N{\rEN4K}fully-productive member of society.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.26,0:25:07.77,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你只需要帮他戒酒\N{\rEN4K}You just have to get him clean
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.77,0:25:09.78,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,编造他过去一年做过什么就好\N{\rEN4K}and fill in the last year of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.23,0:25:11.39,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你是外国人\N{\rEN4K}You're a foreigner.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.11,0:25:13.76,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,人们不在乎你是哪里生人\N{\rEN4K}They don't care where you were born,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.93,0:25:15.18,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,只在乎受孕方式\N{\rEN4K}just how.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.64,0:25:17.79,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,血液又不分国籍\N{\rEN4K}Blood has no nationality.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.37,0:25:20.12,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你的基因是他们想要的\N{\rEN4K}As long as it's got what they're looking for,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.12,0:25:22.19,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是你的万能护照\N{\rEN4K}it's the only passport you'll need.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.04,0:25:25.30,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,谁住在楼上\N{\rEN4K}Who lives up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.46,0:25:28.33,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定不是我\N{\rEN4K}Well, I certainly don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.85,0:25:33.89,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,于是化身为杰罗姆的过程开始了\N{\rEN4K}So began the process of becoming Jerome.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.28,0:25:38.92,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,弱势群体生来最明显的特征之一就是近视\N{\rEN4K}Myopia is one of the most obvious signs of a disadvantaged birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.92,0:25:40.50,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,没有其他办法吗\N{\rEN4K}Isn't there another way?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.00,0:25:44.16,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不能动手术 他们会发现疤痕\N{\rEN4K}Surgery's no good. They'll see the scars.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.83,0:25:47.31,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不戴隐形眼镜就只能装盲人了\N{\rEN4K}It's contact lenses or a white cane.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.42,0:25:51.21,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,再说 你们的眼睛颜色也不一样\N{\rEN4K}Besides, the colour doesn't match.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.09,0:25:55.24,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他说得对 我的眼睛更美\N{\rEN4K}He's right. My eyes are prettier.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.51,0:26:01.50,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道不论你赚多少我都要抽成25%\N{\rEN4K}You understand I take 25% of everything you make.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.50,0:26:03.41,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,假如出了岔子事情没成\N{\rEN4K}If for some reason it doesn't work out,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.41,0:26:06.30,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,所有设备必须在七天内归还\N{\rEN4K}all this equipment must be returned within seven days.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.76,0:26:08.56,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-订金也不能退还 -等等\N{\rEN4K}- And you don't get your deposit back. - Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.56,0:26:11.10,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 你之前不是说20%吗\N{\rEN4K}Wait, wait. I thought you said 20%.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.10,0:26:13.19,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-他跟我说的也是20% -20%\N{\rEN4K}- He told me 20%. - 20%.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.19,0:26:14.88,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,没得商量\N{\rEN4K}It's not negotiable.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.99,0:26:33.10,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-看来差不多了 -还不行\N{\rEN4K}- I guess that's it. - Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.10,0:26:36.25,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-为什么 怎么了 -还有身高的问题\N{\rEN4K}- Why? What? - There's still the matter of height.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.77,0:26:39.73,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-你多高 -一米三七\N{\rEN4K}- What? How tall are you? - Four foot six.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.94,0:26:41.24,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,出车祸前多高\N{\rEN4K}How tall were you before the accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.25,0:26:44.60,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不幸的是 他的身高记录是一米八五\N{\rEN4K}Unfortunately, his profile says he's 6'1".
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.40,0:26:47.95,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那我可以垫增高垫\N{\rEN4K}So, I can wear lifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.01,0:26:51.78,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,就算垫了增高垫 你也没那么高\N{\rEN4K}Even with lifts, you're not that tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.51,0:26:55.60,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那怎么办\N{\rEN4K}So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.99,0:27:02.86,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEN4K}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.08,0:27:04.97,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不行\N{\rEN4K}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.42,0:27:08.92,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 我们从没商量过那个\N{\rEN4K}No. We never discussed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.99,0:27:11.22,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是下定决心了吗 文森特\N{\rEN4K}I thought you were serious, Vincent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.22,0:27:13.27,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我是下定决心了 我不同意\N{\rEN4K}I am serious. I'm not doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.09,0:27:21.31,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会做的\N{\rEN4K}I won't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.50,0:27:29.97,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,杰罗姆再没质疑过我的决心\N{\rEN4K}Jerome never questioned my commitment again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.43,0:27:31.81,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,为了忘却疼痛\N{\rEN4K}I took my mind off the pain
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.81,0:27:35.36,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我提醒自己 等我最终再次站起来时\N{\rEN4K}by reminding myself that when I eventually did stand up,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.36,0:27:38.91,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我就距离星空近了五厘米\N{\rEN4K}I'd be exactly two inches closer to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.32,0:27:40.53,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\rEN4K}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.92,0:27:42.92,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEN4K}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.19,0:27:47.47,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你想去跳舞吗\N{\rEN4K}Do you want to go dancing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.73,0:27:51.43,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须是个右撇子\N{\rEN4K}You had to be a right-hander.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.65,0:27:55.19,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,看来如今没人会特意定制左撇子\N{\rEN4K}I guess no one orders southpaws anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.85,0:27:58.64,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,"杰罗姆·莫罗"\N{\rEN4K}"Jerome Morrow."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.00,0:28:01.19,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,名字真好听\N{\rEN4K}It's a nice name.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.18,0:28:05.41,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我的名字\N{\rEN4K}It's my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.45,0:28:08.12,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,没了它我怎么成为你\N{\rEN4K}I can't be you without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.20,0:28:10.27,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你凭什么认为你能成为我\N{\rEN4K}What makes you think you can be me at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.72,0:28:20.86,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\rEN4K}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.01,0:28:24.10,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,快看\N{\rEN4K}Look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.67,0:28:26.58,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,很棒\N{\rEN4K}It's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.76,0:28:30.28,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,真厉害 是真的吗\N{\rEN4K}I'm impressed. Is it real?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.63,0:28:33.66,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是个色盲吗 文森特\N{\rEN4K}Are you colour-blind too, Vincent?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.24,0:28:36.35,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-这是银牌 -那又怎样\N{\rEN4K}- It's silver. - So?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.37,0:28:40.18,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,杰罗姆·莫罗根本不该站不上最高领奖台\N{\rEN4K}Jerome Morrow was never meant to be one step down on the podium.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.77,0:28:43.44,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我有那么多优势\N{\rEN4K}With all I had going for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.31,0:28:47.21,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,也不过是第二名\N{\rEN4K}I was still second best.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.29,0:28:50.22,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,超凡如我\N{\rEN4K}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.54,0:28:54.76,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你又凭什么指望自己能成功\N{\rEN4K}So how do you expect to pull this off?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.20,0:28:58.84,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我也不知道\N{\rEN4K}I don't know, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.30,0:29:06.02,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你的签名需要再练练\N{\rEN4K}Your signature needs work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.34,0:29:10.62,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就到了考验我们的准备工作的时候\N{\rEN4K}It soon came time to put our preparations to the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.62,0:29:12.12,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,杰罗姆的定制基因\N{\rEN4K}Jerome had been engineered
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.12,0:29:14.95,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,足以满足进入盖特卡公司的一切要求\N{\rEN4K}with everything he needed to get into Gattaca...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.95,0:29:16.96,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但他没这个兴趣\N{\rEN4K}except the desire to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.36,0:29:19.09,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的想进去吗\N{\rEN4K}Do you really want to be in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.40,0:29:22.67,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是想进去 我是想上去\N{\rEN4K}I don't wanna be in there. I wanna be up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.21,0:29:26.28,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,上面有什么\N{\rEN4K}What's up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.61,0:29:29.75,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是我想弄清楚的 杰罗姆\N{\rEN4K}That's want I want to find out, Jerome.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.94,0:29:33.24,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,叫我尤金\N{\rEN4K}Call me Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.86,0:29:36.03,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我的中间名\N{\rEN4K}My middle name.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.07,0:29:38.97,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你要成为杰罗姆\N{\rEN4K}If you're going to be Jerome,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.97,0:29:40.90,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,最好赶紧习惯这名字\N{\rEN4K}you better start getting used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.75,0:29:53.46,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我得出发了 我的样本呢\N{\rEN4K}I gotta get going. Where's my sample?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.46,0:29:55.93,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,在冰箱里 左边那个门\N{\rEN4K}In the refrigerator. Door on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.92,0:30:00.60,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-哪一袋 -随便哪袋都行\N{\rEN4K}- Which pouch? - Any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.04,0:30:05.47,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我该先测试一下吗\N{\rEN4K}You think I should test it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.61,0:30:07.79,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你想测就测呗\N{\rEN4K}If you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.46,0:30:17.86,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,老天 机器出什么毛病了\N{\rEN4K}My God! What's wrong with the machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.86,0:30:19.36,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,机器什么毛病都没有\N{\rEN4K}There's nothing wrong with the machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.36,0:30:21.33,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这是刚采的样 你又喝酒了\N{\rEN4K}It's a hot sample. You've been drinking again!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.33,0:30:21.89,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\rEN4K}I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.89,0:30:24.86,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,老天 尤金 现在才早上八点\N{\rEN4K}Oh, christ, Eugene. it's 8 o'clock in the morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.86,0:30:26.12,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我没喝\N{\rEN4K}I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.77,0:30:36.93,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是闹着玩的 我一小时后就要面试\N{\rEN4K}This is no joke. My interview is in an hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.95,0:30:46.28,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这袋尿液里的伏特加多比尿还多\N{\rEN4K}There's more vodka in this piss than there is piss!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.29,0:30:47.85,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 对不起\N{\rEN4K}All right, l'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.85,0:30:50.25,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我喝了半杯庆祝 抱歉\N{\rEN4K}I had half a glass to celebrate. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.47,0:30:52.58,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,试试周五的 那袋不会有问题\N{\rEN4K}Try Friday. That one will be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.22,0:30:54.89,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩下周三的了\N{\rEN4K}There's only Wednesday left.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.03,0:30:56.77,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,周三 就是那袋\N{\rEN4K}Wednesday. That's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.96,0:31:12.46,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 现在退出还来得及\N{\rEN4K}Listen, it's not too late to back out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.11,0:31:19.31,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是最后一天你我做自己的日子\N{\rEN4K}This is the last day that you're gonna be you and l'm gonna be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.87,0:31:24.75,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\rEN4K}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.48,0:31:55.75,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜\N{\rEN4K}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.21,0:32:00.49,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那面试呢\N{\rEN4K}What about the interview?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.11,0:32:02.13,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才就是了\N{\rEN4K}That was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.05,0:32:12.17,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我通过了\N{\rEN4K}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.28,0:32:15.58,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\rEN4K}Of course you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.10,0:32:27.72,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那段日子都是这样\N{\rEN4K}And that's the way it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.15,0:32:30.90,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,每天我都尽量清理干净皮屑\N{\rEN4K}Each day I would dispose of as much loose skin,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.90,0:32:33.14,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,指甲和毛发\N{\rEN4K}finger nails and hair as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.22,0:32:36.36,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,尽可能不在合格世界里\N{\rEN4K}To limit how much of my In-Valid self
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.36,0:32:38.85,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,留下我这不合格者的痕迹\N{\rEN4K}I would leave in the Valid world.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.80,0:32:47.08,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,同时 尤金准备好他优秀的\N{\rEN4K}At the same time, Eugene prepared samples
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.08,0:32:51.39,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,身体物质样本 供我假扮他使用\N{\rEN4K}of his own superior body matter so that I might pass for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.59,0:32:55.60,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,应付频繁物质测试的定制尿袋\N{\rEN4K}Customized urine pouches for the frequent substance tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.61,0:32:58.86,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,用于安全检查的指尖血袋\N{\rEN4K}Fingertip blood saches for security checks
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.86,0:33:01.76,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,以及装有其他身体物质的小瓶子\N{\rEN4K}and vials filled with other traces.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.59,0:33:06.56,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,尤金为我提供新身份 我则负责付房租\N{\rEN4K}While Eugene supplied me with a new identity, I paid the rent...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.56,0:33:09.73,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,并且让他逐渐习惯上这种生活方式\N{\rEN4K}and kept him in the style to which he'd become accustomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.70,0:33:13.59,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,尤金从没遭受过我们惯常遭遇的歧视\N{\rEN4K}Eugene never suffered from the routine discrimination of the
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.59,0:33:17.52,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,被称为"子宫儿" "依神旨意出生的人" 或"不合格者"\N{\rEN4K}"utero", or "faith birth", or "In-Valid" as we're called.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.52,0:33:20.70,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,"合格者" "试管儿" "人造人"\N{\rEN4K}A "Valid," a "vitro", a "made man"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.79,0:33:23.20,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他背负着另一种重担\N{\rEN4K}he suffered under a different burden:
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.20,0:33:24.90,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,身为完美之人\N{\rEN4K}The burden of perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.66,0:33:29.03,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在是一个相对新的\N{\rEN4K}I was now a member of a relatively new
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.03,0:33:32.34,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,特别遭恨的社会阶层人士\N{\rEN4K}and particularly detested segment of society.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.48,0:33:35.86,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,该阶层的人拒绝打他们手上的那副牌\N{\rEN4K}One of those who refuses to play the hand that he was dealt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.25,0:33:39.17,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,大部分人认为我是"借来的梯子"\N{\rEN4K}I am most commonly known as a "borrowed ladder."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.59,0:33:42.69,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,或是"基因堕落者"\N{\rEN4K}Or a "de-gene-erate."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.74,0:33:50.93,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,凭借杰罗姆·莫罗的身份\N{\rEN4K}In the guise of Jerome Morrow
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.93,0:33:53.63,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我在盖特卡公司一路晋升\N{\rEN4K}I've risen quickly through the ranks of Gattaca.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.97,0:33:56.68,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,只有一位任务主管曾险些\N{\rEN4K}Only one of the mission directors has ever come close to
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.68,0:33:58.78,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,发现我的真实身份\N{\rEN4K}discovering my true identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.33,0:34:03.32,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,奇妙的是 他死后暴露我身份的可能性\N{\rEN4K}Strange to think, he may have more success exposing me in death
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.32,0:34:05.77,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,比他活着时更大\N{\rEN4K}than he ever did in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.01,0:34:30.32,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该能排除自杀可能\N{\rEN4K}I think we can rule out suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.32,0:34:31.37,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么 先生\N{\rEN4K}Excuse me, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.61,0:34:32.50,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\rEN4K}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.24,0:34:35.22,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEN4K}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.34,0:34:41.88,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,要花好一阵子 可能计划得延后了\N{\rEN4K}This is gonna take a while. We may have to push things back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.82,0:35:00.57,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,艾琳 你去协助调查员\N{\rEN4K}Irene, I want you to assist the investigators.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.64,0:35:03.10,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,可是主管 那会让我的工作进度落后\N{\rEN4K}My work, Director. That would put me behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.18,0:35:05.93,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我感谢你付出的牺牲 艾琳\N{\rEN4K}I appreciate your sacrifice, Irene.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.85,0:35:08.81,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,您能确保我不会失去席位吗\N{\rEN4K}Will you see to it that I don't lose my place in line?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.81,0:35:11.63,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你的位子万无一失\N{\rEN4K}Your place is assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.86,0:35:14.46,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,所以麻烦你去告知当局\N{\rEN4K}So would you kindly inform the authorities
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.46,0:35:17.51,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会全力配合\N{\rEN4K}that we will cooperate in any way,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.94,0:35:21.29,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我们不能容忍出大乱子\N{\rEN4K}although we can't tolerate a major disruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.29,0:35:23.40,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-主管 -谢谢你 艾琳\N{\rEN4K}- Director-- - Thank you, Irene.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.94,0:35:25.36,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 主管\N{\rEN4K}Thank you, director.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.15,0:35:30.71,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,主管 这事会影响任务吗\N{\rEN4K}Director, how will this affect the mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.32,0:35:34.10,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们仍按原计划进行\N{\rEN4K}We're still going ahead as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.28,0:35:37.72,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,发射窗口只开放到周末\N{\rEN4K}The launch windows only open until weeks end and...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.72,0:35:40.69,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这次事件虽然是悲剧\N{\rEN4K}Tragic though this event may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.06,0:35:45.19,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但行星也没因此停止转动 不是吗\N{\rEN4K}it hasn't stopped the planets turning, has it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.05,0:35:58.91,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-发生什么了 -我要上去了\N{\rEN4K}- What happened? - I'm going up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.42,0:36:00.38,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,什么时候\N{\rEN4K}When?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.41,0:36:04.94,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-这个周末 -这个周末\N{\rEN4K}- End of the week. - End of the week?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.94,0:36:05.94,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这么快\N{\rEN4K}That soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.35,0:36:09.31,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那任务主管呢\N{\rEN4K}What about the mission director?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.09,0:36:13.18,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\rEN4K}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.25,0:36:16.65,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说真的吗\N{\rEN4K}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.18,0:36:19.67,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们今早在他办公室发现他的尸体\N{\rEN4K}They found him in his office this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.67,0:36:22.53,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他被揍得面目全非 得靠胸牌才能确认身份\N{\rEN4K}beaten so badly. They had to check his name tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.89,0:36:26.18,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说真的\N{\rEN4K}You are serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.40,0:36:32.14,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样了 没什么能阻挡我们上天\N{\rEN4K}So that's it. There's nothing between us and ignition.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.56,0:36:35.73,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我要上去了\N{\rEN4K}I'm going up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.88,0:36:40.57,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-那人被谋杀了 -那又怎样 又不是我杀的\N{\rEN4K}- The man was murdered. - So? I didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.58,0:36:41.16,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我没说是你杀的\N{\rEN4K}I didn't say you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.16,0:36:42.17,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果那人是被谋杀的\N{\rEN4K}But if the man was murdered,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.17,0:36:43.93,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,就会有很多联调局的人去那里\N{\rEN4K}the place is gonna be crawling with Hoovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.93,0:36:47.43,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我宁愿被联调局查 也不要应付任务主管\N{\rEN4K}I'll take my chances with J. Edgars over the mission director.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.58,0:36:49.61,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,再说 就算他们有所发现又怎么样\N{\rEN4K}Besides, what if they do find something?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.73,0:36:52.22,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我略微超出了他们的管辖范围\N{\rEN4K}I'm gonna be slightly out of their jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.15,0:36:59.99,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得立刻一醉方休\N{\rEN4K}We have to get drunk immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.78,0:37:09.45,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-晚上好 先生们 -晚上好\N{\rEN4K}- Good evening, gentlemen. - Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.45,0:37:10.47,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的桌子好了吗\N{\rEN4K}Our table's ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.47,0:37:12.37,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,听说你要离开我们了 莫罗先生\N{\rEN4K}I understand you're leaving us, Mr. Morrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.37,0:37:14.87,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-是啊 看来是这样 -我们会想你的\N{\rEN4K}- Yeah, looks that way. - We're gonna miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.11,0:37:17.52,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-你已经醒过红酒了吧 -当然 先生\N{\rEN4K}- You've opened the wine, I hope? - Of course, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.27,0:37:20.84,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-你给自己倒一杯吧 卡文迪什 -谢谢 先生\N{\rEN4K}- Pour yourself a glass, Cavendish. - Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.64,0:37:46.72,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-多久了{\fs66.833}[几岁]{\fs} -我吗\N{\rEN4K}- How old? - Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.93,0:37:48.02,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这个样本\N{\rEN4K}This specimen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.02,0:37:51.28,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我五分钟前跟他接的吻 那一吻很销魂\N{\rEN4K}I kissed him five minutes ago. A real good one!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.17,0:37:53.68,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看能查出些什么\N{\rEN4K}I'll see what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.51,0:38:02.49,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-你想查全序列吗 -是的 谢谢\N{\rEN4K}- You want the full sequence? - Yes. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.71,0:38:04.77,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,祝好运\N{\rEN4K}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.72,0:38:25.69,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,九点三 理想对象啊\N{\rEN4K}Nine-point-three. Quite a catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.01,0:38:29.95,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 理想对象\N{\rEN4K}Yes. Quite a catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.62,0:38:59.17,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,老天 我跟卡文迪什说过多少次了\N{\rEN4K}God, how many times I've told Cavendish.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.87,0:39:02.88,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这瓶酒顶多是五分钟前开的\N{\rEN4K}This can't have been open more than five minutes ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.88,0:39:05.81,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这种好酒是需要醒的 记住了\N{\rEN4K}Wine like this needs to breathe. Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.81,0:39:08.78,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说在失重状态下\N{\rEN4K}You know, they say when you're weightless...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.65,0:39:12.18,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,是最接近人在子宫中的状态的\N{\rEN4K}is the closest thing to being in the womb.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.85,0:39:17.73,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我简直不敢相信你成功了\N{\rEN4K}I can't believe you pulled this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.68,0:39:20.40,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要把你送上去了\N{\rEN4K}They're sending you up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.30,0:39:23.87,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,上太空啊 老天爷 在所有人中选了你\N{\rEN4K}Up there, for Christs sake! You, of all people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.87,0:39:25.95,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我不愿意想象你要一个人在那间屋子里待一年\N{\rEN4K}I hate to think you're alone in that room for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.95,0:39:27.00,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那就别想\N{\rEN4K}Don't think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.11,0:39:28.70,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,再说了\N{\rEN4K}Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.70,0:39:31.39,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,困着我的那间屋子比你的铁罐子大多了\N{\rEN4K}the room I'm stuck in is bigger than your tin can.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.39,0:39:33.50,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你懂我的意思的 你打算干什么\N{\rEN4K}You know what I'm saying, what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.80,0:39:37.79,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我有书籍相伴 可以在脑海里游历四方\N{\rEN4K}I have my books. I go places in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.71,0:39:40.23,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你能有伴我会更高兴些\N{\rEN4K}I will be happier if you had some company.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.23,0:39:41.30,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,有人来拜访我啊\N{\rEN4K}I have visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.30,0:39:43.50,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,可不是嘛 都是花钱请来的\N{\rEN4K}Yeah. Well, none that you don't pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.50,0:39:45.02,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,免费的话我也不乐意\N{\rEN4K}I wouldn't have it any other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.14,0:39:48.52,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,认真的 你到底打算干些什么\N{\rEN4K}Seriously. What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.99,0:39:52.35,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我打算喝完这一杯\N{\rEN4K}I'm going to finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.11,0:40:08.11,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,每年这个时候的泰坦星是什么样的\N{\rEN4K}What's Titan like this time of year?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.37,0:40:16.28,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,泰坦是什么样的 泰坦是这样的\N{\rEN4K}What's Titan like? Titan is exactly like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.05,0:40:32.06,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,一直以来 它周围都笼罩着厚厚的云层\N{\rEN4K}All the time, it has gotta cloud around it is so thick,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.06,0:40:33.95,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,没人知道云层下面是什么样的\N{\rEN4K}nobody can tell what's underneath.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.46,0:40:36.96,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,也许底下什么都没有\N{\rEN4K}Maybe there's nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.24,0:40:39.42,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有些什么\N{\rEN4K}There's something there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.15,0:40:47.15,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,该你去的 而不是我\N{\rEN4K}You should be going, instead of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.22,0:40:50.33,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么这么说\N{\rEN4K}Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.86,0:40:54.09,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,因为在那上面你的腿就不碍事了\N{\rEN4K}Because up there your legs wouldn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.33,0:41:02.80,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我恐高\N{\rEN4K}I'm scared of heights.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.91,0:41:25.21,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\rEN4K}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.25,0:41:28.41,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要这个吗\N{\rEN4K}Do you want this?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.62,0:41:30.80,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我帮你留一点 要吗\N{\rEN4K}I'll save some for you, shall I?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.20,0:41:41.63,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 真的很对不起\N{\rEN4K}I'm so sorry. I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.63,0:41:43.17,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你可没那么抱歉\N{\rEN4K}You're not that sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.17,0:41:44.81,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的真的很抱歉\N{\rEN4K}I'm really, really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.94,0:41:51.88,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,别折腾我 饶了我吧\N{\rEN4K}Don't give me a hard time. Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.77,0:41:56.27,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,起来 起来\N{\rEN4K}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.27,0:41:58.85,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-对不起 -救命 帮帮忙\N{\rEN4K}- I'm sorry. - Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.85,0:42:00.07,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\rEN4K}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.39,0:42:10.51,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我没醉\N{\rEN4K}You know, I wasn't drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.51,0:42:12.42,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,什么叫你没醉\N{\rEN4K}What do you mean you're not drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.42,0:42:14.23,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我走到那辆车前时\N{\rEN4K}When I walked in front of that car.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.96,0:42:15.91,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,什么车\N{\rEN4K}What car?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.86,0:42:18.92,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我径直走到了车前面\N{\rEN4K}I stepped right out in front of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.44,0:42:23.05,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我这辈子都没有那么清醒过\N{\rEN4K}I'd never been more sober in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.71,0:42:26.73,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,睡吧\N{\rEN4K}Go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.83,0:42:28.72,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我连自杀都做不好 是不是\N{\rEN4K}I couldn't even get that right. Could I?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.89,0:42:34.17,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,如果一开始没能成功 那就继续尝试\N{\rEN4K}If at first you don't succeed, try, try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.52,0:42:35.67,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,睡吧\N{\rEN4K}Go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.79,0:42:43.74,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我为你感到骄傲 文森特\N{\rEN4K}I'm proud of you, Vincent.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.99,0:42:50.32,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定是醉了才会叫我文森特\N{\rEN4K}You must be drunk to call me Vincent.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.84,0:43:33.35,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-需要多久 -二十分钟\N{\rEN4K}- How much do you need? - Twenty minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.16,0:43:56.26,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以走了\N{\rEN4K}You can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.32,0:44:05.40,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 艾琳 你可以走了\N{\rEN4K}It's all right, Irene. You're excused.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.12,0:44:31.20,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们找到要找的人了\N{\rEN4K}We found our man.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.52,0:44:33.08,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这是整个公司里\N{\rEN4K}It's the only specimen in the entire place
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.08,0:44:34.81,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一一个无法解释的样本\N{\rEN4K}that can't be accounted for.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.99,0:44:36.87,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,每隔个十几年 我们总是能走运一回\N{\rEN4K}Every 10 years or so things go our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.87,0:44:38.18,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,睫毛\N{\rEN4K}The eyelash.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.82,0:44:39.63,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你手头有什么信息\N{\rEN4K}What you know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.63,0:44:41.71,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,是一个未注册的不合格者\N{\rEN4K}An unregistered ln-Valid.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.05,0:44:45.37,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,是这里的一个清洁工 几年前失踪了\N{\rEN4K}A janitor here until a few years back when he disappeared out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.37,0:44:47.42,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,所以样本有可能是那时候留下的\N{\rEN4K}So the specimen could have been here since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.69,0:44:49.17,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你看看这四周\N{\rEN4K}Well, take a look at the four side.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.17,0:44:51.51,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得这里没有什么东西能留这么久\N{\rEN4K}I don't think anything lays around here for very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.51,0:44:52.74,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,还有动机的问题\N{\rEN4K}There's also the matter of motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.74,0:44:54.95,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这个清洁工真的会时隔这么久重回这里\N{\rEN4K}Is the janitor gonna come back here after all this time
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.95,0:44:56.27,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,来杀一个他根本不认识的人吗\N{\rEN4K}to kill a man he never knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.27,0:44:58.76,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他的档案确实显示他性格暴力\N{\rEN4K}Well, his profile does suggest the violent temperament.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.37,0:45:00.49,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我没搞错\N{\rEN4K}If I'm not mistaken,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.50,0:45:03.08,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他的档案同时还显示他是个病人\N{\rEN4K}his profile also suggests he's a sick man.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.32,0:45:05.19,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这根睫毛的主人有90%的可能\N{\rEN4K}There's a 90 percent chance the owner of this eyelash
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.19,0:45:07.29,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,已经自然死亡了\N{\rEN4K}is already died himself from natural causes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.30,0:45:09.37,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那就有10%的可能他还活着\N{\rEN4K}That means a 10 percent chance he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.37,0:45:11.32,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这案子相当于是"失物寻主" 长官\N{\rEN4K}It's a lost and found case, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.32,0:45:13.45,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只需找到那个少了一根眼睫毛的人\N{\rEN4K}All we have to do is find the man who has minus an eyelash.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.45,0:45:14.83,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,就找到凶手了\N{\rEN4K}We have the murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.04,0:45:17.56,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我会进行交叉核查 查查他的家人\N{\rEN4K}I'll do a cross-check. I'll find out about his family--
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.56,0:45:20.67,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我查过了 记录显示他没有任何在世亲人\N{\rEN4K}I already run it. He has no record of any living relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.88,0:45:22.38,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那太可惜了 长官\N{\rEN4K}Well, that's a damn shame, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.39,0:45:26.37,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你去查查进出记录 不在场证明 私人恩怨\N{\rEN4K}I want you to check the entry log, alibis, grudges.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.37,0:45:28.55,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,环顾四周 我看大家都不怎么悲伤\N{\rEN4K}I look around I see a lot of dry eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.55,0:45:32.55,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这位任务主管可不怎么广受爱戴\N{\rEN4K}The mission director was not... universally loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.92,0:45:35.08,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他生前主导项目经费的削减\N{\rEN4K}He was leading cutbacks in the programme.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.81,0:45:38.44,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,恕我直言 长官\N{\rEN4K}With all due respect, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.54,0:45:43.81,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,听您的\N{\rEN4K}Whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.24,0:46:02.72,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,杰罗姆 杰罗姆 人肉节拍器\N{\rEN4K}Jerome, Jerome, the metronome.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.06,0:46:05.44,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,可以跟着他的心跳弹钢琴\N{\rEN4K}I could play the piano by that heartbeat of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.60,0:46:11.04,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,主管先生 很高兴通知您我们有嫌疑人了\N{\rEN4K}Mr. Director, you will be pleased to know that we have a suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.04,0:46:13.20,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我真是松了一口气 是谁\N{\rEN4K}That is a relief. Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.20,0:46:15.64,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在大楼南翼找到了一个无法解释的样本\N{\rEN4K}We found an unaccounted-for specimen in the south wing
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.64,0:46:17.81,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这是他的照片\N{\rEN4K}and here's his picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.73,0:46:21.06,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,一个不合格者\N{\rEN4K}An ln-Valid.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.06,0:46:23.16,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还在追查其他的线索\N{\rEN4K}We're still following other leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.50,0:46:27.10,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管如此 我打算马上把这张照片张贴出来\N{\rEN4K}Be that as it may, I'm having this posted immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.10,0:46:28.66,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我很好奇 主管\N{\rEN4K}I'm curious, director.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.95,0:46:33.65,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜好奇心在你们这行是个优势吧\N{\rEN4K}An advantage, I should imagine, in your line of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.38,0:46:36.51,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的 雇用标准\N{\rEN4K}Your... hiring practises.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.51,0:46:39.11,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,应该说我们的"招募哲学"\N{\rEN4K}Our "recruitment philosophy."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.11,0:46:41.26,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,得是个什么样的人 才能进这里\N{\rEN4K}Who do you have to be, to be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.85,0:46:46.36,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,自然 我们的标准要高于普通公民的标准\N{\rEN4K}Naturally, our standard is beyond that of the common citizen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.36,0:46:47.34,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,即便是在你的员工里\N{\rEN4K}Even amongst your people,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.34,0:46:49.14,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你也把他们的优秀分了三六九等\N{\rEN4K}you must have varying levels of excellence.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.14,0:46:51.11,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,偶尔我们也会被迫接受\N{\rEN4K}Occasionally, we've been forced to accept
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.11,0:46:54.14,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,有一些小缺憾的候选人\N{\rEN4K}candidates with minor shortcomings.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.14,0:46:57.64,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但没什么缺憾能影响你进入某些领域\N{\rEN4K}But nothing that would prohibit someone from working in a field...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.68,0:47:00.97,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,比如执法部门\N{\rEN4K}such as law enforcement, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.23,0:47:04.70,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,如今 我们有足够的合适人选\N{\rEN4K}Now, there are enough of the right kind people
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.07,0:47:07.94,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们的新标准变得可行\N{\rEN4K}to warrant a new measuring stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.94,0:47:09.93,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,身体与头脑相称\N{\rEN4K}Bodies with minds to match.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.93,0:47:14.70,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这是让我们得以越走越远的必备条件\N{\rEN4K}Essential, as we push out further and further.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.12,0:47:17.55,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但你依旧密切监测他们的表现\N{\rEN4K}Yet you still closely monitor their performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.55,0:47:20.36,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须确保大家发挥出了自己的潜力\N{\rEN4K}We have to ensure that people are meeting their potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.36,0:47:21.48,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至是超出他们的潜力\N{\rEN4K}And exceeding it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.48,0:47:24.71,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-没有人会超出自己的潜力 -如果有呢\N{\rEN4K}- No one exceeds his potential. - If he did?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.71,0:47:25.40,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这只能说明\N{\rEN4K}It simply means that
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.40,0:47:29.16,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一开始就没有正确地测定他的潜力\N{\rEN4K}we did not accurately gauge his potential in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.07,0:47:44.47,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-你还好吗 杰罗姆 -好极了\N{\rEN4K}- Are you all right, Jerome? - Terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.46,0:48:12.23,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这是过去七天的进出记录\N{\rEN4K}This is the entry log for the last seven days.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.05,0:48:16.34,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己呢 艾琳\N{\rEN4K}What about you, lrene?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.53,0:48:18.95,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你有不在场证明吗\N{\rEN4K}Do you have an alibi?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.26,0:48:23.28,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-我当时是一个人 -太让人意外了\N{\rEN4K}- I was alone. - I find that hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.19,0:48:25.22,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,失陪\N{\rEN4K}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.70,0:48:37.16,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我帮你扔吧 莫罗先生\N{\rEN4K}I'll take care of that for you, Mr. Morrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.26,0:48:52.43,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我不是唯一一个\N{\rEN4K}I see I'm not the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.43,0:48:54.75,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,每次有发射时都抬头看的人\N{\rEN4K}who looks up every time there's a launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.18,0:48:57.68,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-你好 杰罗姆 -你好\N{\rEN4K}- Hello, Jerome. - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.09,0:49:01.56,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,主管的遭遇太可怕了\N{\rEN4K}It's awful about the director.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.35,0:49:04.39,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,可怕的是他居然没早点出事\N{\rEN4K}Awful it didn't happen sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.46,0:49:07.40,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,主管不是曾不止一次威胁\N{\rEN4K}Didn't the director threaten
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.40,0:49:09.81,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,要取消你的任务吗 杰罗姆\N{\rEN4K}to cancel your mission more than once, Jerome?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.89,0:49:12.39,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-的确如此 -有人帮了你一把\N{\rEN4K}- Yes, he did. - Somebody did you a favour.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.83,0:49:14.87,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那你知道我该感谢谁吗\N{\rEN4K}Do you have any idea who's hand that I should be shaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.12,0:49:17.61,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在南翼找到一根睫毛\N{\rEN4K}They found an eyelash in the south wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.70,0:49:20.22,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-有名字吗 -就是个不合格者\N{\rEN4K}- Does it have a name? - Just some ln-Valid.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.03,0:49:24.00,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,杰罗姆\N{\rEN4K}Jerome...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.13,0:49:31.13,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我测了你的基因 看了你的档案\N{\rEN4K}I had you sequenced. I read your profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.49,0:49:33.65,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\rEN4K}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.77,0:49:40.46,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你的确就是他们所说的那样 甚至更出色\N{\rEN4K}Seems you're everything they say you are and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.06,0:49:44.61,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那你呢 艾琳\N{\rEN4K}What about you, lrene?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.23,0:49:47.55,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你和我们一样都是定制基因出生的\N{\rEN4K}You're engineered just like the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.74,0:49:49.90,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我和你们不一样\N{\rEN4K}Not quite like the rest of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.75,0:49:53.46,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,"过高的心脏衰竭发病率"\N{\rEN4K}"Unacceptable likelihood of heart failure."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.46,0:49:55.63,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,手册上就是这么写的\N{\rEN4K}I think that's what the manual says.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.13,0:49:57.62,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我唯一的宇宙之旅\N{\rEN4K}The only trip I'll take in space
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.62,0:50:00.04,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,就是在地球上绕着太阳转\N{\rEN4K}is around the sun on this satellite right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.15,0:50:03.41,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你有什么异样\N{\rEN4K}If there's anything wrong with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.42,0:50:05.29,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,反正我看不出来\N{\rEN4K}I can't see it from where I stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.83,0:50:11.39,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不相信我\N{\rEN4K}If you don't believe me...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.68,0:50:15.90,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,给你\N{\rEN4K}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.17,0:50:18.34,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,拿去\N{\rEN4K}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.77,0:50:28.80,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你还感兴趣就告诉我\N{\rEN4K}If you're still interested, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.18,0:50:34.84,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 被风吹走了\N{\rEN4K}I'm sorry. The wind caught it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.74,0:51:00.87,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,请查看最新的盖特卡公司公告\N{\rEN4K}Please check the latest Gattaca bulletin.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.92,0:51:12.32,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,杰罗姆\N{\rEN4K}Jerome.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.83,0:51:17.43,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我们说过的进近航道吗\N{\rEN4K}Is this the approach path we discussed?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.62,0:51:21.44,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,正是 主管\N{\rEN4K}Absolutely, director.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.33,0:51:25.45,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 没错\N{\rEN4K}Quite right. Quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.42,0:51:44.39,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,听好我说的话 我要我订购的东西\N{\rEN4K}Listen to what I'm saying to you. I want what I ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.13,0:51:47.47,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,颜色完全不一样\N{\rEN4K}It's a completely different colour.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.95,0:51:49.85,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不 跟你说话我已经说烦了\N{\rEN4K}No. I'm bored of talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.40,0:51:53.11,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我说烦了 我再打给你\N{\rEN4K}I'm bored. I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.80,0:51:57.12,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才那是负责你染发剂的公司\N{\rEN4K}That was the company that selects your hair dye.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.12,0:51:59.89,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们寄给我的是"夏麦" 而不是"蜜穹"\N{\rEN4K}They've sent me "Summer Wheat" instead of "Honey Dome".
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.50,0:52:02.35,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,是个傻子都知道两种深浅不同\N{\rEN4K}Any fool knows it's two shades light.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.36,0:52:04.20,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,她问 "你想改变什么"\N{\rEN4K}She said, "What are you trying to change?"
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.20,0:52:07.00,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想改变 我们不能改变\N{\rEN4K}I don't want the change. We can't use the change.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.15,0:52:11.58,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们寄给我的那五盒 我可能还要付钱\N{\rEN4K}Now I'll probably gonna have to pay for the five boxes they've sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.58,0:52:13.14,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能留在这里\N{\rEN4K}We can't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.15,0:52:15.31,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我要打交道的那些蠢货 你都难以想象\N{\rEN4K}The idiots I have to deal with. You wouldn't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.52,0:52:17.67,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们觉得是我杀了那个任务主管\N{\rEN4K}They think I killed the mission director.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.29,0:52:21.83,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们为什么会那么觉得\N{\rEN4K}What makes them think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.56,0:52:24.59,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们找到了我的睫毛\N{\rEN4K}They found my eyelash.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.55,0:52:28.83,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-在哪里 -在走廊\N{\rEN4K}- Where? - In the corridor.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.36,0:52:32.62,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这样还好 幸亏不是在你眼皮上找到的\N{\rEN4K}Well, it could be worse. They could've found it in your eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.62,0:52:35.74,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们把我的照片贴得到处都是\N{\rEN4K}They have got my picture plastered up all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.85,0:52:38.99,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我只要转过身就会看见自己的脸\N{\rEN4K}I can't turn around without seeing my own face.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.56,0:52:41.75,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-他们会认出我的 -他们认不出来\N{\rEN4K}- They'll recognise me. - They won't recognise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.75,0:52:45.60,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-他们会认出来的 -我都认不出来\N{\rEN4K}- They'll recognise me. - I don't recognise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.87,0:52:47.36,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不会联想到是你的\N{\rEN4K}They won't marry the eyelash to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.36,0:52:48.96,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们没法相信\N{\rEN4K}They won't believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.96,0:52:50.19,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们中的一个精英\N{\rEN4K}that one of their elites
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.19,0:52:52.09,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,一直以来都在耍他们\N{\rEN4K}could've suckered them all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.09,0:52:55.79,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我们什么都不改 照计划进行\N{\rEN4K}No, no, no. We change nothing. We do as we planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.92,0:52:58.67,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你是杰罗姆·莫罗 一级领航员\N{\rEN4K}You're Jerome Morrow, Navigator 1st Class.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.67,0:53:02.59,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是杰罗姆·莫罗 我是谋杀案嫌犯\N{\rEN4K}I'm not Jerome Morrow. I'm a murder suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.56,0:53:04.68,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\rEN4K}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.68,0:53:07.79,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么 那是不止一天的量\N{\rEN4K}What are you doing? That's more than a day's worth!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.13,0:53:10.29,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-等下 -我们不能留在这里\N{\rEN4K}- Wait. - We can't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.52,0:53:12.08,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,住手\N{\rEN4K}Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.88,0:53:15.04,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,行 行啊\N{\rEN4K}Oh, fine. Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.21,0:53:18.20,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,想走就走好了 但是不许拿走那东西\N{\rEN4K}You leave if you want. But you're not taking that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.20,0:53:20.30,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那东西 是我的\N{\rEN4K}That stuff... It's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.25,0:53:25.18,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我知道你会在最后阶段害惨我\N{\rEN4K}I could've rented myself out to somebody with a spine
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.77,0:53:29.95,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么都会找个有骨气的替身\N{\rEN4K}if l'd known you'd go belly-up on me at the last fucking gasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.85,0:53:33.22,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能现在撂担子\N{\rEN4K}You can't quit on me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.64,0:53:35.79,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我投入太多了\N{\rEN4K}I've put too much into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.88,0:53:37.09,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我怎样\N{\rEN4K}What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.46,0:53:39.66,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,推着轮椅进去 自己完成工作吗\N{\rEN4K}Wheel in there and finish the job myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.82,0:53:44.50,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,尤金 他们会找到我的\N{\rEN4K}Eugene, they are going to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.66,0:53:48.50,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是不懂 是吧\N{\rEN4K}You still don't understand, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.41,0:53:53.61,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们看着你的时候 看见的不再是你\N{\rEN4K}When they look at you, they don't see you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.61,0:53:55.05,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们看见的只有我\N{\rEN4K}They only see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.58,0:54:12.79,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,让你的睫毛在眼皮上乖乖待好了\N{\rEN4K}Keep your lashes on your lids where they belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.56,0:54:17.46,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么这么不小心\N{\rEN4K}How could you be so careless?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.48,0:54:51.92,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我出去一趟\N{\rEN4K}I'm going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.50,0:54:53.87,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你去哪里\N{\rEN4K}Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.47,0:54:58.39,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我明天会被捕 我今晚要出去\N{\rEN4K}Well, if I'm gonna get arrested tomorrow, I'm going out tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.63,0:55:00.35,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得出去合适吗\N{\rEN4K}Are you sure that's a good idea to go out?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.35,0:55:03.57,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,是你说什么都不要改\N{\rEN4K}Well, it's your idea not to change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.80,0:55:06.34,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-谁会去 -所有人都去\N{\rEN4K}- Who's going? - I'd say everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.77,0:55:09.13,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人\N{\rEN4K}Everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.81,0:55:12.08,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我不去 会很可疑的\N{\rEN4K}If I don't go, it'll look suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.80,0:55:15.80,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你不想看起来很可疑吧\N{\rEN4K}You don't want to look suspicious, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.78,0:55:22.11,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEN4K}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.97,0:56:23.33,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,谁下的命令\N{\rEN4K}Who ordered this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.24,0:56:25.68,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在这里做什么\N{\rEN4K}What are we doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.39,0:56:27.93,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我在追查一条线索\N{\rEN4K}I'm following a lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.08,0:56:29.64,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉了 长官 但这是我的工作\N{\rEN4K}Forgive me, sir, but that's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.64,0:56:31.37,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个警探 我总是追查线索\N{\rEN4K}I'm a detective. I follow leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.38,0:56:34.07,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么觉得睫毛的主人在这里\N{\rEN4K}What makes you think the owner of the eyelash is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.13,0:56:36.08,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个不合格者 长官\N{\rEN4K}He's an In-Valid, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.08,0:56:39.05,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,想找不合格者 不就得去他们平时总去的地方吗\N{\rEN4K}Where do we look for In-Valids but where the In-Valids are?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.05,0:56:40.51,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个不合格者\N{\rEN4K}He's an In-Valid.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.06,0:56:45.97,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他这个不合格者聪明到这么多年都无影无踪\N{\rEN4K}He's an In-Valid clever enough to go unregistered all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.97,0:56:48.76,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得他现在就会束手就擒吗\N{\rEN4K}Do you think he's likely to lie down for us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.77,0:56:50.41,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得应该怎么办 长官\N{\rEN4K}Well, what would do you suggest, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.41,0:56:52.51,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,重回现场进行讯问\N{\rEN4K}Move the enquiry back to the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.51,0:56:54.44,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,在盖特卡公司方圆八公里的范围内\N{\rEN4K}Draw a five-mile radius around Gattaca,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.45,0:56:56.65,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,重新排查 随机拦截讯问\N{\rEN4K}sweep again. Random stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.19,0:57:22.58,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个盖特卡公司的领航员\N{\rEN4K}You're a navigator? At Gattaca?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.97,0:57:24.77,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,仪器就这么说的 不是吗\N{\rEN4K}That's what it says, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.94,0:57:27.98,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这上面没说你是个瘸子\N{\rEN4K}It doesn't say you're crippled.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.45,0:57:30.17,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不是瘸子\N{\rEN4K}I'm not crippled.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.63,0:57:33.28,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是在训练时伤到了腿 蠢货\N{\rEN4K}I hurt my leg training, you moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.44,0:57:36.39,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么敢质疑我\N{\rEN4K}How dare you question me?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.39,0:57:37.69,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rEN4K}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.78,0:57:39.30,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你警号多少\N{\rEN4K}What's your number?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.02,0:57:40.89,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 算了\N{\rEN4K}All right, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.89,0:57:43.51,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 你警号多少 蠢货警察\N{\rEN4K}No, what's your number, you fucking flatfoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.51,0:57:46.01,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我都说算了 你要怎样 要我道歉吗\N{\rEN4K}I said forget it. What do you want? An apology?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.01,0:57:48.67,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,很伤你 是不是 你很伤心\N{\rEN4K}It gets to you, doesn't it? It gets to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.67,0:57:50.67,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我能做的事 你就只能想想\N{\rEN4K}that I can do what you can only dream of.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.67,0:57:53.04,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我要离开这个满是污垢的星球了\N{\rEN4K}I'm getting off this ball of dirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.05,0:57:56.76,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么敢质疑我 这简直是骚扰\N{\rEN4K}How dare you question me? That's harassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.76,0:57:57.95,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,是我不对\N{\rEN4K}My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.95,0:58:01.24,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你警号多少 你警号多少\N{\rEN4K}What's your number? What's your number?!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.50,0:58:05.39,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我提醒你 这里是犯罪现场\N{\rEN4K}May I remind you that this is a crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.39,0:58:07.29,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这个人在这儿做什么\N{\rEN4K}What's this man doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.55,0:58:09.39,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这儿干什么 老头子\N{\rEN4K}What are you doing, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.83,0:58:11.54,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我在工作 先生\N{\rEN4K}Doing my job, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.74,0:58:14.15,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这是证据\N{\rEN4K}This is evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.52,0:58:16.68,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但这只是垃圾\N{\rEN4K}But it's just trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.09,0:59:10.46,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你之前不知道吗\N{\rEN4K}You didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.04,0:59:12.44,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,知道\N{\rEN4K}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.45,0:59:14.04,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,很奇妙 不是吗\N{\rEN4K}Wonderful, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.04,0:59:18.61,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,要么12个手指 要么1个 这就是演奏\N{\rEN4K}Twelve fingers or one, it's how you play.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.19,0:59:22.43,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这首曲子只有12根手指才能弹\N{\rEN4K}That piece can only be played with 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.73,0:59:42.50,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\rEN4K}What's all this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.71,0:59:46.39,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,可能没什么\N{\rEN4K}It's probably nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.14,1:00:25.58,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好别\N{\rEN4K}Hey, you better not, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.02,1:00:28.19,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想给你一个被污染的样本\N{\rEN4K}I don't want to give you a contaminated specimen.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.84,1:00:29.97,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你明白我的意思吗\N{\rEN4K}Get my meaning?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.87,1:01:00.95,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEN4K}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.89,1:01:04.09,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你永远不知道那些棉签插进过什么地方\N{\rEN4K}You never know where those swabs have been.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.49,1:01:08.30,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我想带你去看样东西\N{\rEN4K}I want to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.12,1:01:56.95,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,快过来 我们要错过了\N{\rEN4K}Come on, we'll miss it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.10,1:02:28.15,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,快走吧 快走 不然要错过了\N{\rEN4K}Come on. Come on. We'll miss it. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.80,1:03:16.35,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我就说吧\N{\rEN4K}What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.71,1:03:39.78,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-真奇怪 -怎么了\N{\rEN4K}- Strange. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.78,1:03:41.54,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你的眼睛看起来不一样了\N{\rEN4K}Your eyes look different.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.90,1:03:43.60,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是光线原因\N{\rEN4K}I guess it must be the light.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.16,1:03:46.53,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是\N{\rEN4K}Must be.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.81,1:04:12.94,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,完全匹配 干得漂亮\N{\rEN4K}Positive match. I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.21,1:04:16.73,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,杯子肯定是第一次排查之后才用过的\N{\rEN4K}The cup was definitely used since the original sweep.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.46,1:04:19.50,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,两个样本 两天\N{\rEN4K}Two samples, two days.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.51,1:04:21.36,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,要么是嫌疑人回到犯罪现场\N{\rEN4K}Either the suspect went back to the scene of the crime
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.36,1:04:23.91,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,喝了杯水 但是没人会那么渴\N{\rEN4K}to get a drink of water and I don't know anybody that thirsty,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.47,1:04:25.89,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,要么他还在这儿工作\N{\rEN4K}or he still works there.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.89,1:04:28.21,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是检查了所有的后勤人员吗\N{\rEN4K}I thought we checked all the service staff.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.79,1:04:31.00,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我想他不再负责打扫这里了\N{\rEN4K}I don't think he cleans up the place any more.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.00,1:04:33.10,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得是有人靠欺骗手段通过了预测试\N{\rEN4K}I have a feeling might be there one that false pretests,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.11,1:04:34.75,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,打别人的命运之牌\N{\rEN4K}playing somebody else's hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.84,1:04:38.23,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,"借来的梯子" 进入盖特卡公司工作吗\N{\rEN4K}A borrowed ladder, at Gattaca?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.67,1:04:41.31,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这听起来很牵强 但并不是没有可能\N{\rEN4K}It's far-fetched, but it's not like there is no possibility.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.31,1:04:44.49,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得很难相信他可能是最重要的员工之一\N{\rEN4K}I find it hard to believe he could be one of the lead workers.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.49,1:04:46.07,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,即使他通过了安全系统\N{\rEN4K}Even if he got pass the security system,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.07,1:04:48.31,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他也没有那种脑力和体力\N{\rEN4K}he would not have metal faculty or the physical stamina.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.31,1:04:49.92,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,也许我们小看他了\N{\rEN4K}Maybe we underestimate him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.09,1:04:51.40,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,也许他是一个冒名顶替者\N{\rEN4K}Maybe he is an impostor
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.40,1:04:53.00,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,也许主管发现了他的身份\N{\rEN4K}and maybe the director found out about him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.00,1:04:54.47,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这可能是他的动机\N{\rEN4K}That could be his motive.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.48,1:04:58.10,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,应该对范围内的每个员工进行静脉取样\N{\rEN4K}I say we sample every employee within the parameters, intravenously.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.10,1:05:00.49,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,三分之二的员工可都包含在内\N{\rEN4K}Two-thirds of their workforce fall into that category.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.49,1:05:02.06,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这样要让他们关门好几天\N{\rEN4K}We'd be closing them down for days.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.06,1:05:05.09,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 采指血和尿液就足够了\N{\rEN4K}No, a fingertip sample or a urine should be sufficient.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.09,1:05:07.79,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我建议从静脉抽血\N{\rEN4K}I suggest blood from the vein.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.46,1:05:10.17,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,希望我没有越界\N{\rEN4K}I hope I'm not out of line.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.96,1:05:41.73,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,只是时间问题 长官 只是时间问题\N{\rEN4K}It's only a matter of time, sir. Only matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.16,1:05:47.04,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,柱塞是干什么的 拉马尔\N{\rEN4K}What's with the plungers, Lamar?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.74,1:05:52.16,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你要开血库吗\N{\rEN4K}You open up a blood bank?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.16,1:05:56.39,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 执法部门的先生担心\N{\rEN4K}No, the gentleman of the law enforcement have concerned
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.39,1:05:59.84,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我的检测方法可能已经被人利用了\N{\rEN4K}that my testing methods may have been compromised.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.46,1:06:13.81,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天呐\N{\rEN4K}Goddamn!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.81,1:06:16.35,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-杰罗姆 对不起 -兄弟 你得多练习下\N{\rEN4K}- Jerome, l'm sorry. - Dude, you got practice some more.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.35,1:06:19.12,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-让我看看 -没关系 没关系\N{\rEN4K}- Hey, let me look at that. - It's all right. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.16,1:06:20.24,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\rEN4K}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.02,1:06:22.92,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好抽到足够的量了\N{\rEN4K}Luckily, looks like we have enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.92,1:06:25.90,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,如果需要更多 可以从他的鞋子上取\N{\rEN4K}If you need any more, you can always get it off his shoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.47,1:06:43.78,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,艾琳\N{\rEN4K}Irene.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.91,1:06:49.88,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,所以终究不是你干的\N{\rEN4K}So you didn't do it after all?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.46,1:06:54.17,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我 我想是有人抢先了\N{\rEN4K}Oh, no, I... I Guess somebody beat me to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.48,1:06:55.96,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是吧\N{\rEN4K}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.88,1:07:04.64,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我两天后升空\N{\rEN4K}I'll leave in two days.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.06,1:07:11.17,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你知道 但是\N{\rEN4K}I guess you know that. But...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.15,1:07:25.67,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他是最后一个\N{\rEN4K}That's the last.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.20,1:07:28.26,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,有点不对劲\N{\rEN4K}Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.26,1:07:30.45,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他不在这里 这是一条死胡同\N{\rEN4K}He's not here. It's a blind alley.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.53,1:07:32.28,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我们漏掉了一些东西\N{\rEN4K}No, we missed something.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.95,1:07:34.09,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该再测一次\N{\rEN4K}I say we test again.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.09,1:07:38.09,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,还测 我不允许你们再打断行动了\N{\rEN4K}Test? I cannot allow you to disrupt operations any further.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.09,1:07:40.80,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你一点都不担心你们中间有杀人犯\N{\rEN4K}You're not at all concerned about having a murderer in your midst.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.80,1:07:44.81,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,目前 你们在这儿更是一种威胁\N{\rEN4K}Right now, your presence is creating more of a threat.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.90,1:07:46.85,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们接下来这次的发射窗口\N{\rEN4K}The window for our latest launch is open
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.85,1:07:49.85,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,每70年才有一次 为期7天\N{\rEN4K}for seven days once every 70 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.85,1:07:52.88,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,准时发射至关重要\N{\rEN4K}So it's rather crucial we leave on time.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.35,1:07:55.96,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,任务对你来说意义重大 是吗\N{\rEN4K}Mission means a great deal to you, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.59,1:07:59.38,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但你那位已故的同事反对它 对吗\N{\rEN4K}And your late colleague opposed it, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.83,1:08:02.31,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,重新再看看我的档案 警探\N{\rEN4K}Take another look at my profile, detective.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.77,1:08:05.83,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会找到任何和暴力相关的\N{\rEN4K}You won't find a violent bone in my body.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.83,1:08:08.56,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 主管 他不会再烦扰你了\N{\rEN4K}My apologies, director. He won't trouble you any further.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.07,1:08:13.65,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是唯一我们可以调查的地方\N{\rEN4K}This is not the only place we can look.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.18,1:08:16.52,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rEN4K}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.25,1:08:19.89,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们开始调查其他地方吧\N{\rEN4K}Let's start making the rounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.22,1:09:24.03,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我比大多数人都幸运\N{\rEN4K}I'm luckier than most.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.05,1:09:26.89,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,却不如某些人幸运\N{\rEN4K}Not as lucky as some.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.94,1:09:30.46,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我略知一二\N{\rEN4K}I know something about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.46,1:09:34.14,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 杰罗姆 你的心脏有过什么问题\N{\rEN4K}You do, Jerome? What heart problem did you ever have?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.32,1:09:37.47,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你的心也碎过吗\N{\rEN4K}Did you get yours broken once?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.08,1:09:44.47,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我有一个疯狂的想法\N{\rEN4K}I had this crazy idea
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.54,1:09:48.37,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你对那起谋杀案比对我更感兴趣\N{\rEN4K}that you were more interested in the murder case than in me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.75,1:09:51.14,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你说对了\N{\rEN4K}And you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.58,1:09:56.34,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,确实是个疯狂的想法\N{\rEN4K}That's a crazy idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.14,1:10:01.75,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你想跳舞吗\N{\rEN4K}Would you like to dance?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.68,1:10:40.04,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,说起来真怪\N{\rEN4K}It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.49,1:10:41.69,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你竭尽全力\N{\rEN4K}You work so hard,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.69,1:10:44.86,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,就为了逃离一个地方\N{\rEN4K}you do anything you can to get away from the place,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.96,1:10:48.46,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,当你终于有机会离开的时候\N{\rEN4K}and when you finally get your chance to leave,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.25,1:10:52.13,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,却找到了留下的理由\N{\rEN4K}you find a reason to stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.13,1:11:00.06,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,一年很长\N{\rEN4K}A year is a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.86,1:11:03.46,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,也没有很长\N{\rEN4K}Not so long.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.30,1:11:06.34,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,只是绕太阳一圈\N{\rEN4K}Just once around the sun.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.95,1:11:17.77,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好 很高兴见到你们\N{\rEN4K}Hello, everyone. Nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.77,1:11:19.39,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我是今晚的侦探\N{\rEN4K}I'm your detective for the evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.39,1:11:21.60,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,请不要离开这栋楼\N{\rEN4K}Please don't leave the premises.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.86,1:11:24.01,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我说了不许走\N{\rEN4K}I said nobody leave!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.01,1:11:27.04,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,难道我说的是某种奇怪的外语吗\N{\rEN4K}Am I speaking in some strange foreign language?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.59,1:11:30.21,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,检查假发 检查镜片 检查假牙\N{\rEN4K}Check hairpieces, check lenses, check dentures.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.21,1:11:33.76,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,餐巾纸 烟头 杯中的唾液都带走\N{\rEN4K}I want napkins, I want cigarette butts, I want saliva off cups.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.61,1:11:37.85,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那张脸很熟悉 检查他\N{\rEN4K}That's a familiar face. Check him out, will you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.46,1:11:45.46,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-我以为你想跳舞 -是的\N{\rEN4K}- I thought you wanted to dance. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.46,1:11:48.03,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-不好意思 你们要去哪 -我知道 等下\N{\rEN4K}- Excuse me, where're you going? - I know. Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.90,1:11:50.30,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,杰罗姆\N{\rEN4K}Jerome!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.39,1:11:52.77,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,杰罗姆\N{\rEN4K}Jerome!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.80,1:12:03.05,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-你疯了吗 -快走\N{\rEN4K}- Are you insane? - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.76,1:12:24.53,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们去哪了 他们去哪儿了\N{\rEN4K}Where did they go? Where did they go?!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.64,1:12:31.76,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,快起来 来\N{\rEN4K}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.21,1:12:45.47,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你不明白吗 我做不到\N{\rEN4K}Don't you understand? I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.14,1:12:47.47,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚刚做到了\N{\rEN4K}You just did.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.81,1:12:51.02,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,别碰自己的脸 别吞咽 别吐唾沫\N{\rEN4K}Don't touch your face. Don't swallow. Don't spit.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.02,1:12:52.60,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,把他的牙齿弄干净\N{\rEN4K}Get someone clean his teeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.00,1:12:58.60,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,文森特\N{\rEN4K}Vincent!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.98,1:13:04.86,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,文森特\N{\rEN4K}Vincent!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.53,1:13:13.15,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,文森特是谁\N{\rEN4K}Who's Vincent?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.76,1:13:20.02,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我\N{\rEN4K}I...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.83,1:13:26.30,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都别说\N{\rEN4K}Don't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.53,1:16:24.62,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,是怎么回事\N{\rEN4K}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.93,1:16:30.50,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你腿上的伤疤\N{\rEN4K}The scars on your legs?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.32,1:16:38.00,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你记得99年的克莱斯勒男爵车吗\N{\rEN4K}Remember the '99 Chrysler LeBaron?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.87,1:16:42.48,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,它的前挡泥板就这么高\N{\rEN4K}This is the exact height of the front fender.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.55,1:16:44.39,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,过马路的时候看错了方向\N{\rEN4K}Looked left instead of right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.65,1:16:51.22,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这个故事是新编的还是一直都用的\N{\rEN4K}Did you just make that up, or do you use it all the time?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.73,1:16:53.20,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直都这么说\N{\rEN4K}I use it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.04,1:16:58.58,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你和主管的死有关\N{\rEN4K}I know you had something to do with the director's death.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.76,1:17:00.25,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不是这样的 艾琳\N{\rEN4K}That's not true, Irene.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.27,1:17:11.94,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是昨晚那个男的吗\N{\rEN4K}Isn't that the man from last night?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.05,1:17:16.23,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他谁也不是\N{\rEN4K}He's nobody.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.17,1:17:29.41,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我们这里最优秀的之一\N{\rEN4K}He's one of our best.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.54,1:17:33.74,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我确定他跟这件事一点关系也没有\N{\rEN4K}I'm certain he has nothing to do with this business.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.55,1:17:36.83,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,杰罗姆·莫罗\N{\rEN4K}Jerome Morrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.70,1:17:48.50,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你脸色不太好 杰罗姆\N{\rEN4K}You don't look well, Jerome.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.00,1:17:51.70,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,何不回家休息呢\N{\rEN4K}Why don't you go home?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.00,1:18:05.53,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-有什么能帮到你的 -我在找杰罗姆·莫罗\N{\rEN4K}- Can I help you? - I'm looking for Jerome Morrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.94,1:18:07.70,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 他病了 有点反胃\N{\rEN4K}I'm sorry. He's ill. A little nausea.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.70,1:18:09.43,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这是出任务前的常见症状\N{\rEN4K}It's quite common before a mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.47,1:18:10.43,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\rEN4K}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.69,1:18:12.90,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我想上门拜访一下他\N{\rEN4K}I want to pay him a visit.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.91,1:18:14.74,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该知道他住哪儿\N{\rEN4K}I understand you can show me the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.53,1:19:02.56,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道他是谁 对吗 艾琳\N{\rEN4K}You don't know who he is, do you? Irene.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.45,1:19:14.29,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEN4K}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.00,1:19:18.69,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,接电话 快点 快点\N{\rEN4K}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.63,1:19:26.27,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-你好 -尤金 我需要你今天做你自己\N{\rEN4K}- Hello? - Eugene, I need you to be yourself for the day.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.66,1:19:28.40,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我从来都不擅长这个 记得吗\N{\rEN4K}I was never very good at it, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.40,1:19:30.04,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,调查员要过去了\N{\rEN4K}The investigators are coming by.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.04,1:19:33.24,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-我假装患病在家 -是啊 你说过很多遍了\N{\rEN4K}- I'm supposed to be sick. - So you keep telling me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.55,1:19:35.66,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-我有多少时间 -没多少\N{\rEN4K}- How long have I got? - Not long.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.66,1:21:26.17,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,看来他不在家\N{\rEN4K}I guess he's not home.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.48,1:21:32.01,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-哪位 -我找杰罗姆·莫罗\N{\rEN4K}- Hello? - I'm here to see Jerome Morrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.07,1:21:33.85,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,是我 上来吧\N{\rEN4K}That's me. Come up.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.51,1:21:37.01,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,看来他在家\N{\rEN4K}I guess he's home.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.56,1:22:13.47,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,请进\N{\rEN4K}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.64,1:22:17.51,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,请进\N{\rEN4K}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.49,1:22:21.71,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 亲爱的\N{\rEN4K}Hello, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.30,1:22:26.52,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,亲一下\N{\rEN4K}Where's my kiss?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.65,1:22:32.53,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你看起来好多了\N{\rEN4K}Good to see you're feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.54,1:22:37.15,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了 你来了我就好了\N{\rEN4K}Of course, now that you're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.37,1:22:47.55,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这位朋友是谁\N{\rEN4K}Who's your friend?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.40,1:22:50.67,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么我能帮上忙的吗\N{\rEN4K}How can I help?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.35,1:22:53.02,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他是为主管的案子来的\N{\rEN4K}It's about the director.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.70,1:22:55.71,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,又来\N{\rEN4K}Again?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.78,1:22:58.56,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-希望没有太麻烦你 -不 不麻烦\N{\rEN4K}- I hope it's no trouble. - No, no. No trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.03,1:23:02.23,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,原谅我不能带你们转转\N{\rEN4K}Forgive me for not giving you a guided tour.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.23,1:23:04.18,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不能下次再做吗\N{\rEN4K}Couldn't we do this another time?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.62,1:23:06.13,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要太久\N{\rEN4K}Well, this won't take a moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.54,1:23:08.60,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,没准他能测出来我患了什么病\N{\rEN4K}Maybe he can tell me what I've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.82,1:23:47.49,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为会是谁\N{\rEN4K}Who were you expecting?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.24,1:24:32.60,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-什么事 -我们抓到人了 长官\N{\rEN4K}- Yes? - We have our man, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.60,1:24:34.23,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-你们抓到了 -我们抓到他了\N{\rEN4K}- You have him? - We have him in custody.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.23,1:24:35.37,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上来\N{\rEN4K}I'll come right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.26,1:25:01.54,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么样 杰罗姆\N{\rEN4K}How are you, Jerome?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.81,1:25:04.50,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,还不赖 杰罗姆\N{\rEN4K}Not bad, Jerome.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.21,1:25:08.98,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底怎么上来的\N{\rEN4K}How the hell did you get up here?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.10,1:25:13.02,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直都能走路 只是装作不能走\N{\rEN4K}Oh, I could always walk. I've been faking it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.18,1:25:32.26,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,艾琳 艾琳 艾琳\N{\rEN4K}Irene. Irene. Irene.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.26,1:25:34.66,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-别碰我 -听我说 艾琳\N{\rEN4K}- Don't touch me! - Listen to me, lrene.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.81,1:25:36.40,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不知道你是谁\N{\rEN4K}I don't even know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.40,1:25:38.52,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是昨天的我\N{\rEN4K}I'm the same person I was yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.17,1:25:41.33,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想再听你的谎话了 杰罗姆\N{\rEN4K}I can't hear anymore of your lies, Jerome.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.33,1:25:45.25,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字是文森特 文森特·安东·弗里曼\N{\rEN4K}My name is Vincent. Vincent Anton Freeman.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.25,1:25:47.43,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我是依神旨意出生的人 或者叫基因堕落者\N{\rEN4K}I'm a faith birth or a de-gene-erate
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.43,1:25:48.79,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,或者随便你怎么叫\N{\rEN4K}or whatever you wanna call it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.89,1:25:50.81,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不是杀人犯\N{\rEN4K}But l'm not a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.19,1:25:54.63,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你是上帝赐的孩子\N{\rEN4K}You're a God-child?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.47,1:25:58.39,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们至少有这一个共同点\N{\rEN4K}We do have one thing in common.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.19,1:26:01.95,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,只不过我活不了二三十年那么久\N{\rEN4K}Only I don't have 20 or 30 years left in mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.95,1:26:04.42,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经超出预期寿命很多年了\N{\rEN4K}Mine's already 10,000 beats overdue.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.76,1:26:06.16,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\rEN4K}It's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.12,1:26:09.88,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你的存在说明一切皆有可能\N{\rEN4K}You're the authority on what is not possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.22,1:26:11.60,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吗 艾琳\N{\rEN4K}Aren't you, lrene?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.17,1:26:16.85,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他们让你费尽全力寻找瑕疵\N{\rEN4K}They have got you looking so hard for any flaw
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.40,1:26:19.73,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,久了以后 你就只看得到瑕疵\N{\rEN4K}that after awhile that's all you see.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.73,1:26:24.31,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,无论付出什么代价\N{\rEN4K}For whatever it's worth,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.01,1:26:27.49,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我要告诉你 这是有可能的\N{\rEN4K}I'm here to tell you that it is possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.19,1:26:30.72,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,是有可能的\N{\rEN4K}It is possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.08,1:27:12.92,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜 长官 你破案了\N{\rEN4K}Congratulations, sir. You did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.02,1:27:16.62,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,在死去主管的眼睛里找到了他的唾液\N{\rEN4K}His spit was found in the dead director's eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.05,1:27:18.36,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,一个无法解释的样本\N{\rEN4K}An unaccounted-for specimen.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.36,1:27:20.22,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我执念于一根睫毛时\N{\rEN4K}While I was busy obsessing about an eyelash,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.22,1:27:23.00,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你的直觉指出了正确的方向\N{\rEN4K}your instincts took us into the right direction.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.50,1:27:26.61,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,所以那个不合格者与这案子没关系\N{\rEN4K}So the ln-Valid had nothing to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.62,1:27:28.45,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我们的这位朋友单独行动的\N{\rEN4K}No, our friend here acted alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.45,1:27:31.16,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这次任务是他的一切 不是吗\N{\rEN4K}This mission meant everything to him, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.76,1:27:37.73,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他知道如果错过了这次的发射窗口\N{\rEN4K}He knows that if they miss this launch window,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.74,1:27:39.64,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他活不到下次发射了\N{\rEN4K}he won't live to see the next one.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.75,1:27:41.62,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,现在没有什么能阻止发射\N{\rEN4K}And since nothing can stop the launch now,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.62,1:27:44.56,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他表现得非常 非常合作\N{\rEN4K}he's been very, very cooperative.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.82,1:27:52.14,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜你今晚会庆祝一下 长官\N{\rEN4K}So I imagine you will be celebrating tonight, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.80,1:27:53.81,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\rEN4K}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.40,1:28:12.87,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得她喜欢我们\N{\rEN4K}I think she likes us.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.96,1:28:15.48,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 给她一点时间\N{\rEN4K}Yeah, sure. Just give her a little time,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.49,1:28:17.21,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,她会接受的\N{\rEN4K}she'll get used to the idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.43,1:28:19.76,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他什么样\N{\rEN4K}What was he like?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.89,1:28:21.62,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-那个警察吗 -是啊\N{\rEN4K}- Who? The cop? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.62,1:28:23.65,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-就一个警察 -你知道他的名字吗\N{\rEN4K}- He was just a cop. - Did you get his name?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.86,1:28:26.04,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字才是谈话重点\N{\rEN4K}Actually, my name was the topic of conversation.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.04,1:28:27.55,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他会回来的\N{\rEN4K}Yeah. Well, he'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.64,1:28:30.01,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你都说他们找到行凶者了 结束了\N{\rEN4K}You have already said they have their man. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.01,1:28:31.40,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不 没有结束\N{\rEN4K}No, it's not over.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.60,1:28:34.03,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我得见见他\N{\rEN4K}I have to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.47,1:29:01.46,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,文森特\N{\rEN4K}Vincent?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.22,1:29:14.03,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天 你变了\N{\rEN4K}My God, you have changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.78,1:29:20.52,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,太久不见 你都认不出自己的兄弟了吗\N{\rEN4K}Has it been so long you don't recognise your own brother?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.58,1:29:22.93,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是兄弟吗\N{\rEN4K}Are we brothers?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.38,1:29:25.87,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的父母到死都以为 你早就不在了\N{\rEN4K}Our parents both died thinking they'd outlived you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.74,1:29:29.23,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直不信\N{\rEN4K}I had my doubts.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.75,1:29:31.07,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你来这里做什么 安东\N{\rEN4K}What are you doing here, Anton?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.07,1:29:32.71,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这问题该我来问你\N{\rEN4K}I should ask you that question.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.56,1:29:35.16,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我有权来到这里\N{\rEN4K}I have a right to be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.17,1:29:37.16,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,而你没有\N{\rEN4K}You don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.89,1:29:41.04,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你听起来像很确信似的\N{\rEN4K}You almost sound as if you believe that.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.12,1:29:43.85,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有杀人\N{\rEN4K}I committed no murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.33,1:29:47.04,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,让你失望了\N{\rEN4K}You must be disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.23,1:29:49.76,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你在冒名顶替\N{\rEN4K}You committed fraud.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.80,1:29:54.12,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 你麻烦大了 文森特 我能带你离开这里\N{\rEN4K}Listen, you're in a lot of trouble, Vincent. I can get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.12,1:29:57.43,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我费了多大力气才进来这里吗\N{\rEN4K}Do you have any idea what it took to get in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.43,1:30:00.43,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经无处可去了 你立刻跟我走\N{\rEN4K}You've gone as far as you can go. You come with me now.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.96,1:30:04.13,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-我还能走几百万公里 -都结束了\N{\rEN4K}- There's still a few millions of miles left to go. - It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.13,1:30:07.28,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你成功的唯一方式就是看我失败吗\N{\rEN4K}Is that the only way you can succeed is to see me fail?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.28,1:30:08.46,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-我告诉你 -天呐\N{\rEN4K}- I'm telling you-- - God!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.46,1:30:12.29,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,现在连你都来教训我什么能做 什么不能做了吗\N{\rEN4K}Even you are gonna tell me what I can and can't do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.78,1:30:18.22,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,可能你没注意到 我不需要救助\N{\rEN4K}In case you haven't noticed, I don't need any rescuing.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.35,1:30:20.86,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但你曾经需要过\N{\rEN4K}But you did once.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.51,1:30:26.80,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你得到所有答案了 你怎么解释那件事\N{\rEN4K}Well, you've got all the answers. How do you explain that?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.39,1:30:29.97,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那天你没有打败我 是我打败了自己\N{\rEN4K}You didn't beat me that day. I beat myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.14,1:30:32.78,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是想说服谁\N{\rEN4K}Who are you trying to convince?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.16,1:30:35.56,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你想让我证明给你看吗\N{\rEN4K}Do you want me to prove it to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.24,1:30:38.17,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那不重要 安东\N{\rEN4K}It's not important, Anton.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.30,1:30:40.84,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我早就忘了\N{\rEN4K}It's forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.35,1:30:42.56,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我会证明给你看\N{\rEN4K}I'll prove it to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.85,1:30:45.23,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你想让我证明给你看吗 那我就证明给你看\N{\rEN4K}Do you want me to prove it to you? I'll prove it to you!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.20,1:30:47.22,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEN4K}I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.02,1:31:54.11,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,文森特\N{\rEN4K}Vincent!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.07,1:31:57.12,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,文森特\N{\rEN4K}Vincent!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.93,1:32:00.53,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里是岸 我们游太远了\N{\rEN4K}Where's the shore? We're too far out!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.53,1:32:02.59,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-你要放弃吗 -我们游太远了\N{\rEN4K}- You wanna quit? - We're too far out.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.59,1:32:03.60,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你要放弃吗\N{\rEN4K}You wanna quit?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.39,1:32:06.38,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEN4K}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.64,1:32:30.66,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,文森特\N{\rEN4K}Vincent!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.47,1:32:34.25,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么做到的 文森特\N{\rEN4K}How are you doing this, Vincent?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.91,1:32:37.55,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这一切你到底是怎么做到的\N{\rEN4K}How have you done any of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.56,1:32:39.74,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得回去了\N{\rEN4K}We have to go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.74,1:32:42.46,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,太晚了 我们都快游到另一边了\N{\rEN4K}It's too late for that. We're closer to the other side.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.45,1:32:46.28,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,什么另一边 你想让我俩都淹死吗\N{\rEN4K}What other side? You want to drown us both?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.31,1:32:48.95,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你想知道我怎么做到的\N{\rEN4K}You want to know how I did it?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.09,1:32:51.95,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是答案 安东\N{\rEN4K}This is how I did it, Anton.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.22,1:32:54.65,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我从没留过往回游的力气\N{\rEN4K}I never saved anything for the swim back.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.64,1:34:41.40,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你看不见 对吗\N{\rEN4K}You couldn't see, could you?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.87,1:34:44.76,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,那晚过马路的时候\N{\rEN4K}That night, crossing the street.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.80,1:34:48.52,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但你还是穿过去了\N{\rEN4K}You crossed anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.45,1:35:06.01,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你还感兴趣\N{\rEN4K}If you're still interested,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.05,1:35:08.14,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,就告诉我\N{\rEN4K}let me know.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.22,1:35:16.31,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\rEN4K}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.52,1:35:23.17,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,被风吹走了\N{\rEN4K}The wind caught it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.19,1:36:18.85,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你今天不是要飞走吗\N{\rEN4K}You're flying today, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.09,1:36:21.91,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你看你怎么这么凌乱\N{\rEN4K}Look at what a mess you're in.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.77,1:36:29.02,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来 你的样本准备好了\N{\rEN4K}Come on, I have your samples ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.17,1:36:32.51,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我去的地方不需要样本\N{\rEN4K}I don't need any samples where I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.27,1:36:37.95,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你回来的时候可能会需要\N{\rEN4K}You might when you get back.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.85,1:36:44.64,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,够你用两辈子了\N{\rEN4K}Everything you need to last you two lifetimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.01,1:36:49.88,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要做这些\N{\rEN4K}Why have you done all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.82,1:36:53.52,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这样当你需要杰罗姆时 他永远都在\N{\rEN4K}So Jerome will always be here when you need him.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.26,1:36:57.38,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,-你要去哪里 -我也要去旅行\N{\rEN4K}- Where are you going? - I'm travelling, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.80,1:37:03.50,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么感谢你\N{\rEN4K}I don't know how to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.91,1:37:07.06,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,不不\N{\rEN4K}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.74,1:37:09.56,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,占便宜的是我\N{\rEN4K}I got the better end of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.30,1:37:12.44,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我只借给你我的身体\N{\rEN4K}I only lent you my body.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.07,1:37:15.70,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你借给我的是梦想\N{\rEN4K}You lent me your dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.18,1:37:27.85,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,上楼再看\N{\rEN4K}Not until you're upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.00,1:38:03.19,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\rEN4K}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.25,1:38:04.64,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,新政策\N{\rEN4K}New policy.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.17,1:38:13.80,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,发射让你紧张了吗\N{\rEN4K}Flight got you nervous?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.91,1:38:17.26,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,出了点问题 拉马尔\N{\rEN4K}Well, there's a problem, Lamar.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.27,1:38:19.81,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我没跟你提过我儿子吧\N{\rEN4K}I never did tell you about my son, did l?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.29,1:38:22.10,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他很崇拜你\N{\rEN4K}He's a big fan of yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.26,1:38:32.56,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,记住我曾是众人中的佼佼者\N{\rEN4K}Just remember that I was as good as any and better than most.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.63,1:38:34.41,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,他想申请来到这里\N{\rEN4K}He wants to apply here.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.73,1:38:36.48,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,即使我飞上去再飞回来\N{\rEN4K}I could have gone up and back
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.48,1:38:38.46,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,也没人比我更聪明\N{\rEN4K}and nobody would've been the wiser.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.94,1:38:43.01,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,遗憾的是 我儿子不完全是他们保证的那样\N{\rEN4K}Unfortunately, my son's not all that they promised.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.13,1:38:46.50,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但之后 谁知道他会做什么呢\N{\rEN4K}But then, who knows what he could do?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.26,1:38:50.20,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\rEN4K}Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.81,1:39:08.42,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,供你日后参考\N{\rEN4K}For future reference,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.46,1:39:12.14,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,右撇子不会用左手扶着\N{\rEN4K}right-handed men don't hold it with their left.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.12,1:39:14.72,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,这只是其一\N{\rEN4K}Just one of those things.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.26,1:39:30.23,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,你要错过发射了 文森特\N{\rEN4K}You're going to miss your flight, Vincent.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.96,1:42:19.33,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管我从不属于这个世界\N{\rEN4K}For someone who was never meant for this world,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.71,1:42:21.21,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,但我必须承认\N{\rEN4K}I must confess,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.29,1:42:23.76,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我突然有点舍不得离开\N{\rEN4K}I'm suddenly having a hard time leaving it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.07,1:42:26.82,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 他们说\N{\rEN4K}Of course, they say
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.82,1:42:29.92,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,我们身体的每个原子都曾是星球的一部分\N{\rEN4K}every atom in our bodies was once part of a star.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.94,1:42:33.53,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,或许我不是在离开\N{\rEN4K}Maybe l'm not leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.87,1:42:36.52,Default4k,NTP,0,0,0,,或许我踏上了回家的路\N{\rEN4K}Maybe l'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.93,1:39:26.93,Default4k,,0,0,0,,
